Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.36,0:02:35.78,Default,,0,0,0,,这儿是什么地方？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.45,0:02:49.33,Default,,0,0,0,,(旧金山)
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.34,0:02:55.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我生活中有不少荒唐事\N{\fnArial\fs30}My life doesn't really make sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.55,0:02:56.67,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.84,0:02:59.55,Default,,0,0,0,,有段时间我常常问自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}I used to ask myself a lot of questions about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.05,0:03:03.89,Default,,0,0,0,,"斯科特 你离过婚又坐过牢 怎么就成复仇者了？"\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Scott, you're a divorced ex-con. How are you an Avenger?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.05,0:03:05.85,Default,,0,0,0,,"怎么就跟美国队长去穿越时空了？"\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Why are you time traveling with Captain America?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.06,0:03:07.52,Default,,0,0,0,,"这太荒唐了"\N{\fnArial\fs30}"That doesn't make sense."
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.35,0:03:10.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我的生活发生了许多变化\N{\fnArial\fs30}A lot has changed about my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.10,0:03:13.65,Default,,0,0,0,,但不管走到哪儿 大家都会问我一件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}But everywhere I go, people ask me the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.81,0:03:14.98,Default,,0,0,0,,你能跟我的狗合影吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you take a picture with my dog?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.90,0:03:17.53,Default,,0,0,0,,"斯科特 你有什么打算？"\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Scott, what about now?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.69,0:03:18.74,Default,,0,0,0,,"以后干嘛？"\N{\fnArial\fs30}"What's next?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.90,0:03:20.32,Default,,0,0,0,,"接下来的路往哪儿走？"\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Where does the ride take you?"
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.15,0:03:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我要是知道 那还有什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I knew that, it wouldn't be a ride.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.37,0:03:24.37,Default,,0,0,0,,加油\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.83,0:03:28.95,Default,,0,0,0,,-这几年过得魔幻 人人都是 -嘿 你好 最近好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}-It's been a crazy few years. For everyone. -Hey, hi. How are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.12,0:03:30.54,Default,,0,0,0,,东西都帮你准备好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything is ready for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.71,0:03:31.71,Default,,0,0,0,,你太贴心了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.87,0:03:33.25,Default,,0,0,0,,不用 不用\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.42,0:03:34.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不收你的钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your money's no good here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.96,0:03:37.09,Default,,0,0,0,,-你还要跟我搞这套？ -当然要\N{\fnArial\fs30}-Are we still talking about that? -Yes, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.13,0:03:39.55,Default,,0,0,0,,鲁宾 你最棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rubin, you are the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.34,0:03:42.26,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你 蜘蛛侠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Spider-Man.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.18,0:03:46.97,Default,,0,0,0,,现在让我们把时间花在重要的事上\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, let's make time for the stuff that really matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.14,0:03:48.35,Default,,0,0,0,,见见老朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.22,0:03:51.14,Default,,0,0,0,,发现一些新朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Friends you didn't even know you had.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.52,0:03:53.23,Default,,0,0,0,,(本世纪最佳员工 斯科特·朗 "蚁人")
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.23,0:03:55.23,Default,,0,0,0,,记住在你背后推过你一把的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember the people who got you here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.40,0:03:56.65,Default,,0,0,0,,没有他们就没有今天的你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You couldn't have done it without them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.57,0:04:00.65,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 我就是个被芭斯罗缤炒了的家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, I'm just a guy who got fired from Baskin-Robbins.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.36,0:04:03.24,Default,,0,0,0,,有时你就是会走运\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sometimes you just get lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.41,0:04:05.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我就走运 遇见了霍普·凡·戴恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm lucky I met Hope Van Dyne.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.53,0:04:06.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你们都认识她吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you know who she is.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.08,0:04:08.08,Default,,0,0,0,,(皮姆凡戴恩基金会)
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.08,0:04:10.16,Default,,0,0,0,,她拿回了她爸爸的公司\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's taken back her dad's company.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.37,0:04:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,致力于用皮姆粒子改变世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now she's using the Pym Particle for global change.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.25,0:04:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,很多人都说想拯救世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}A lot of people say they want to save the world...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.67,0:04:18.46,Default,,0,0,0,,而霍普每天都在这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}but Hope, she saves it every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.63,0:04:19.63,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.80,0:04:20.88,Default,,0,0,0,,(国际人道主义服务奖)
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.22,0:04:22.42,Default,,0,0,0,,非常感谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.59,0:04:26.51,Default,,0,0,0,,植树造林 平价住房 粮食生产\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reforestation. Affordable housing. Food production.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.68,0:04:28.26,Default,,0,0,0,,她不浪费一分一秒\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's not wasting a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.23,0:04:36.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我至今不敢相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}I still can't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.06,0:04:39.02,Default,,0,0,0,,这一切本来不可能发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}None of this should have happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.19,0:04:40.19,Default,,0,0,0,,可就是发生了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it did.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.86,0:04:43.82,Default,,0,0,0,,这个世界还挺美好\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a pretty good world.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.99,0:04:45.70,Default,,0,0,0,,还好我们救了它\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm glad we saved it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.86,0:04:47.28,Default,,0,0,0,,(城市之光书店)
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.45,0:04:48.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我会怀念那些行动吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Do I miss the action?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.70,0:04:49.53,Default,,0,0,0,,(斯科特·朗：不可忽视小人物)
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.54,0:04:50.83,Default,,0,0,0,,有时会\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.33,0:04:53.37,Default,,0,0,0,,复仇者联盟需要我时 我会去吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Will I be there when the Avengers need me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.54,0:04:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,当然会\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Absolutely.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.67,0:04:56.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我永远不会背弃他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}"I'd never turn my back on them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.13,0:05:00.42,Default,,0,0,0,,但现在 我只想当一个好爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}"But right now, the only job I want is being a dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.76,0:05:03.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我爱你 凯茜\N{\fnArial\fs30}"I love you, Cassie.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.26,0:05:05.68,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你成为我的英雄\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Thanks for being my hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.34,0:05:09.30,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起 我错过了你几年的生日\N{\fnArial\fs30}"And I'm sorry I missed some birthdays.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.01,0:05:13.27,Default,,0,0,0,,对天底下所有孩子们\N{\fnArial\fs30}"And for the rest of you kids out there...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.43,0:05:14.56,Default,,0,0,0,,给你们点小建议\N{\fnArial\fs30}"word of advice.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.64,0:05:17.06,Default,,0,0,0,,不要忽视小人物\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Look out for the little guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.48,0:05:18.48,Default,,0,0,0,,敢于犯错\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Make mistakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.69,0:05:20.69,Default,,0,0,0,,勇于冒险\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Take chances.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.44,0:05:23.78,Default,,0,0,0,,生活教会了我一件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Because if there's one thing life's taught me...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.94,0:05:27.36,Default,,0,0,0,,成长的空间 永远都有\N{\fnArial\fs30}"there's always room to grow."
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.66,0:05:35.29,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉 是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, that's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.46,0:05:36.37,Default,,0,0,0,,(旧金山监狱)
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.00,0:05:38.42,Default,,0,0,0,,监狱找我干嘛？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why is jail calling?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.96,0:05:40.92,Default,,0,0,0,,朗！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lang!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.09,0:05:43.84,Default,,0,0,0,,-朗！ -我在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}-Lang! -I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.01,0:05:45.42,Default,,0,0,0,,出来 跟我走\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, come on. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.43,0:05:48.51,Default,,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.51,0:05:54.98,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 她没事吧？有什么消息？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. Is she okay? Have you heard anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.14,0:05:56.14,Default,,0,0,0,,还没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not yet. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.23,0:05:58.56,Default,,0,0,0,,嗨 霍普 嘿 爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, Hope. Hey, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.73,0:06:00.52,Default,,0,0,0,,凯茜 怎么回事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cassie. What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.69,0:06:01.69,Default,,0,0,0,,在这儿签字\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sign here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.86,0:06:04.69,Default,,0,0,0,,就是进监狱那档子事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, just jail stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.49,0:06:06.49,Default,,0,0,0,,还给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.95,0:06:08.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道是你干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know it was you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.07,0:06:10.07,Default,,0,0,0,,你确定？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.24,0:06:11.45,Default,,0,0,0,,当时可不容易看清\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, it was kind of hard to see...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.62,0:06:14.49,Default,,0,0,0,,毕竟你们朝公园里的和平示威者扔了那么多催泪弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}through all that tear gas you fired into the park full of peaceful protestors.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.66,0:06:15.41,Default,,0,0,0,,它在哪儿？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.58,0:06:17.62,Default,,0,0,0,,真可怜 你肯定觉得很丢脸\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. This must be really embarrassing for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.79,0:06:22.79,Default,,0,0,0,,不过我捡到了这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did find this though.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.13,0:06:29.68,Default,,0,0,0,,你把警车缩小了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You shrank a cop car?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.84,0:06:30.93,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么想的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What were you thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.09,0:06:32.85,Default,,0,0,0,,不然我该怎么办？袖手旁观？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was I supposed to do? Look the other way?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.01,0:06:34.93,Default,,0,0,0,,他们半夜里驱赶无家可归露营的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were clearing out a homeless camp in the middle of the night.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.10,0:06:36.85,Default,,0,0,0,,-我不是说… -警察想把那些人赶去哪儿？\N{\fnArial\fs30}-No, I'm not saying that... -And where do they expect them to go?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.02,0:06:38.94,Default,,0,0,0,,他们在烁灭时没了家又不能怪他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not their fault that they lost their homes in the Blip.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.10,0:06:39.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.10,0:06:43.02,Default,,0,0,0,,现在没人租得起房 除了家财万贯的富二代\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one can even afford rent right now, unless you're some trust-fund asshole.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.19,0:06:44.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是要教你做事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not telling you what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.44,0:06:45.73,Default,,0,0,0,,-我只是想… -教她做事\N{\fnArial\fs30}-I'm just saying... -Telling her what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.90,0:06:47.24,Default,,0,0,0,,教我做每一件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Telling me exactly what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.40,0:06:48.86,Default,,0,0,0,,不 你做你想做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you do what you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.03,0:06:50.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是建议你换种方式\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm suggesting another way to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.99,0:06:51.99,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.16,0:06:53.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我跟你妈妈保证过\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I promised your mom...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.62,0:06:56.08,Default,,0,0,0,,你只能在我们眼皮底下使用这些东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}that you would only use this stuff when one of us was around.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.25,0:06:57.25,Default,,0,0,0,,这种科技很危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's really dangerous tech.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.41,0:06:58.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道它很危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know it's dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.91,0:07:01.17,Default,,0,0,0,,万一被警察没收了呢？万一被你弄丢了呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if the cops took it from you? What if you lost it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.33,0:07:02.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我可没弄丢战衣\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't lose the suit.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.50,0:07:03.34,Default,,0,0,0,,你有战衣？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have a suit?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.50,0:07:04.71,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 你还有战衣？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, you have a suit?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.88,0:07:06.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我能照顾好自己 好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know how to take care of myself, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.42,0:07:08.30,Default,,0,0,0,,相信我 我现在已经很熟练了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust me. I'm pretty good at it by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.51,0:07:10.51,Default,,0,0,0,,好痛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ouch.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.10,0:07:14.56,Default,,0,0,0,,-我不是那个意思 对不起 -我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}-I didn't mean it like that. I'm sorry. -I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.72,0:07:16.01,Default,,0,0,0,,没事 没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's okay. It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.18,0:07:17.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.43,0:07:19.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我只想让你过普通的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just think you should get to have a normal life.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.14,0:07:21.94,Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸 我六岁时就有一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad, a guy dressed like a bee...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.10,0:07:23.98,Default,,0,0,0,,穿得像蜜蜂的人跑到家里来杀我\N{\fnArial\fs30}tried to kill me in my room when I was six.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.90,0:07:26.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我的生活从没普通过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've never had a normal life.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.99,0:07:29.40,Default,,0,0,0,,听点音乐吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about some music?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.95,0:07:32.07,Default,,0,0,0,,那一刻 我只想着\N{\fnArial\fs30}"And in that moment, all I could think was...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.24,0:07:34.53,Default,,0,0,0,,浩克是怎么把我变成小宝宝的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}"'How did the Hulk turn me into a baby?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.70,0:07:36.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我会永远都是小宝宝吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}"'Will I be a baby forever?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.70,0:07:37.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我是浩克的宝宝吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Am I the Hulk's baby?"
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.12,0:07:39.83,Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸 你在听你自己的书吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad, are you listening to your own book?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.00,0:07:42.37,Default,,0,0,0,,-但我早已做好准备 -嗯？不 这是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}-"But I was ready for anything. -Hmm? No, that's...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.46,0:07:44.08,Default,,0,0,0,,-这是电台节目 -史蒂夫和我关系变好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}-It's just the radio. -"Steve and I grew close over that."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.25,0:07:45.75,Default,,0,0,0,,-爸爸 快关掉 -奇怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}-Dad, turn it off. -It's so weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.92,0:07:47.75,Default,,0,0,0,,这个开关出问题了 关不掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something's wrong with this switch. It won't turn off.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.92,0:07:48.96,Default,,0,0,0,,叫你快关掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said turn it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.13,0:07:50.34,Default,,0,0,0,,你说什么？开响点？好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that? Turn it up? All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.51,0:07:53.09,Default,,0,0,0,,没过多久 来了一只太空浣熊\N{\fnArial\fs30}"A little after that, a raccoon from space showed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.26,0:07:54.89,Default,,0,0,0,,他大概不知道我叫什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}"I don't think he knew my name.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.05,0:07:57.39,Default,,0,0,0,,见到一只会说话的浣熊 我很开心\N{\fnArial\fs30}"I was just happy to meet a raccoon who could talk."
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.68,0:08:02.10,Default,,0,0,0,,借过一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.27,0:08:03.35,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.15,0:08:06.23,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.98,0:08:09.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你的诺贝尔奖在路上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Nobel Prize is in the mail.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.57,0:08:12.11,Default,,0,0,0,,它最好是 我这招省了八块钱呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}It better be. I just saved eight bucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.86,0:08:14.24,Default,,0,0,0,,天啊 我真崇拜你\N{\fnArial\fs30}God, I admire you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.62,0:08:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.78,0:08:18.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我一直很怀念这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}I missed this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.58,0:08:20.33,Default,,0,0,0,,量子领域没有比萨吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}No pizza in the Quantum Realm?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.12,0:08:23.42,Default,,0,0,0,,没有 什么都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.58,0:08:25.83,Default,,0,0,0,,妈妈 你可以跟我们说说\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, Mom, you can talk about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.38,0:08:27.38,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你想的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.54,0:08:30.55,Default,,0,0,0,,亲爱的 我在那儿被困了三十年\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sweetheart, I spent 30 years down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.51,0:08:34.13,Default,,0,0,0,,现在我只想活好当下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanna live right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.22,0:08:41.39,Default,,0,0,0,,凯茜 你这次进监狱交新朋友了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, Cassie, did you make any new friends in the slammer this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.56,0:08:42.64,Default,,0,0,0,,外公\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grandpa.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.10,0:08:44.10,Default,,0,0,0,,这次？\N{\fnArial\fs30}"This time"?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.90,0:08:45.73,Default,,0,0,0,,难道还有上次？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was there a last time?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.90,0:08:47.81,Default,,0,0,0,,上次其实不能算\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, last time barely counts.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.94,0:08:49.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我都不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.11,0:08:50.98,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么没跟我说？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why didn't you call me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.15,0:08:52.40,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我料到你会这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause I knew you'd be like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.57,0:08:54.40,Default,,0,0,0,,其实我可以派蚂蚁去救你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would've just broken you out with ants.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.57,0:08:55.91,Default,,0,0,0,,够了 开家庭会议\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, you know what? Family meeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.07,0:08:57.07,Default,,0,0,0,,能开会谈谈吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can we have a family meeting?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.24,0:08:58.24,Default,,0,0,0,,现在不就在谈吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isn't that what we're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.41,0:08:59.37,Default,,0,0,0,,但我想谈的是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I mean about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.54,0:09:01.41,Default,,0,0,0,,大家放任她胡来的这种态度\N{\fnArial\fs30}About everybody being so fine with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.16,0:09:05.42,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 你想帮助别人 我明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, you wanna help. I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.58,0:09:07.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我懂 凯茜 我很理解\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do, Cassie. I really do.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.25,0:09:08.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我是怕你浪费人生\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I don't want you wasting your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.67,0:09:10.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我的人生至少还干了些事\N{\fnArial\fs30}At least I'm still trying to do something with mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.17,0:09:15.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我可是拯救过世界的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I literally saved the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.18,0:09:16.01,Default,,0,0,0,,真的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.18,0:09:17.89,Default,,0,0,0,,从没听你提起过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, yeah, you never mentioned that before.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.05,0:09:19.68,Default,,0,0,0,,大家注意 斯科特拯救过世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, everybody, Scott saved the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.85,0:09:21.01,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉怎么样 斯科特？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How was that for you, Scott?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.18,0:09:22.47,Default,,0,0,0,,你应该出本书讲讲\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should write a book about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.64,0:09:24.06,Default,,0,0,0,,哈哈 真幽默\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ha ha. Hilarious.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.23,0:09:26.10,Default,,0,0,0,,你们没变成灰多亏了我 不用谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you're welcome for all not being dust.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.27,0:09:27.73,Default,,0,0,0,,那你现在在干嘛？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what do you do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.57,0:09:30.90,Default,,0,0,0,,签名售书？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sign books?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.19,0:09:33.90,Default,,0,0,0,,你还是当年那个勇闯维斯塔公司\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aren't you the guy who broke into VistaCorp?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.40,0:09:35.78,Default,,0,0,0,,大老远飞去德国\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aren't you the guy who flew all the way to Germany...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.95,0:09:37.91,Default,,0,0,0,,跟美国队长在机场打架的人吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}just to fight Captain America at the airport?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.07,0:09:40.24,Default,,0,0,0,,是和美国队长並肩作战\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fight with Captain America at the airport.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.95,0:09:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我才不会跟美国队长打\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wouldn't fight Captain America.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.16,0:09:44.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我又没疯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not insane.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.83,0:09:46.46,Default,,0,0,0,,还有很多人需要帮助 爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}People still need help, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.62,0:09:50.25,Default,,0,0,0,,至少我们还在努力做点有用的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}At least we're trying to do something that matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.76,0:09:54.80,Default,,0,0,0,,"我们"是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's "we"?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.63,0:09:58.09,Default,,0,0,0,,你们三个在搞什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you three up to?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.01,0:10:00.01,Default,,0,0,0,,搞科学\N{\fnArial\fs30}Science.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.06,0:10:03.39,Default,,0,0,0,,用蚂蚁\N{\fnArial\fs30}With ants.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.31,0:10:05.56,Default,,0,0,0,,蚂蚁科学\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ant science.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.94,0:10:08.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我才不信呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't believe you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.02,0:10:11.32,Default,,0,0,0,,让他瞧瞧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's just show him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.82,0:10:16.82,Default,,0,0,0,,它们在造什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are they building?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.99,0:10:18.11,Default,,0,0,0,,是你在控制吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you doing this?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.28,0:10:21.49,Default,,0,0,0,,不是 都是它们自己搞的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, no, they built their own tech.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.66,0:10:23.12,Default,,0,0,0,,蚂蚁很聪明\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pretty smart ants.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.29,0:10:25.04,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 在你们都…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, so when you were all...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.20,0:10:28.21,Default,,0,0,0,,消失的那五年里 我闲着没事干\N{\fnArial\fs30}like, gone those five years, I had a lot of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.37,0:10:30.67,Default,,0,0,0,,就开始翻汉克外公以前写的日志\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I started reading Grandpa Hank's old journals...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.83,0:10:32.79,Default,,0,0,0,,彻底迷上了量子领域 然后…\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I got really into the Quantum Realm and...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.67,0:10:34.67,Default,,0,0,0,,量子领域？\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Quantum Realm?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.13,0:10:38.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道大家对那儿没好印象 怕你们着急我就没说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know we all have a history there, and I didn't want to freak anyone out...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.34,0:10:39.26,Default,,0,0,0,,其实我们一直在研究\N{\fnArial\fs30}but we've been talking about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.43,0:10:40.84,Default,,0,0,0,,她爱提问题 好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}She had some questions, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.01,0:10:44.18,Default,,0,0,0,,别人受我启发 我拦不住啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't help if people are inspired by me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.52,0:10:49.35,Default,,0,0,0,,你一直在研究量子领域？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you've been studying the Quantum Realm?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.15,0:10:52.27,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么不来问我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why didn't you ask me about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.44,0:10:54.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我问过你 妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}I tried, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.69,0:10:55.82,Default,,0,0,0,,很多次\N{\fnArial\fs30}A lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.98,0:10:57.65,Default,,0,0,0,,每次你都不愿意说\N{\fnArial\fs30}You never wanted to talk about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.82,0:10:59.07,Default,,0,0,0,,凯茜很有求知欲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cassie's just been curious...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.24,0:11:00.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我们就给了她一些指点\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we gave her some pointers.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.07,0:11:04.70,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是单纯的蚂蚁科学 对吗 亨利？\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't exactly ant science, is it, Henry?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.58,0:11:07.87,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道量子领域有多危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know how dangerous the Quantum Realm is.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.04,0:11:08.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我们都知道 妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, we all do, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.04,0:11:10.58,Default,,0,0,0,,谁也没说要去量子领域\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody's going to the Quantum Realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.75,0:11:12.58,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我们造了这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why we made this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.21,0:11:16.13,Default,,0,0,0,,类似探索深空或深海的探测器\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like a satellite for deep space or the ocean.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.92,0:11:20.22,Default,,0,0,0,,但它探索量子领域\N{\fnArial\fs30}But Quantum.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.68,0:11:23.85,Default,,0,0,0,,只要有张地图\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just need a map.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.43,0:11:27.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我们就能探索研究整个量子领域\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then we can study and explore the entire Quantum Realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.56,0:11:30.35,Default,,0,0,0,,再也不用亲自去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never even have to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.52,0:11:35.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你女儿在地下室里造了个亚原子哈勃望远镜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your daughter built a subatomic Hubble Telescope in a basement.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.44,0:11:40.86,Default,,0,0,0,,要是你们消失时我有这种工具\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, if I had something like this when you were gone...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.87,0:11:45.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我就能找到你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}then I could have found you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.70,0:11:49.71,Default,,0,0,0,,太了不起了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.75,0:11:51.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我做梦都想不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm blown away.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.38,0:11:55.67,Default,,0,0,0,,这要怎么用？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How does it work?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.84,0:11:58.80,Default,,0,0,0,,有点像以前家里那台双向无线电\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's kinda like that two-way radio we used to have.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.21,0:12:00.88,Default,,0,0,0,,从这儿发个信号过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You send a signal down from here...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.05,0:12:03.01,Default,,0,0,0,,收集到数据后再发送回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then it collects the data, and it sends it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.18,0:12:04.14,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.55,0:12:08.10,Default,,0,0,0,,你在向量子领域发送信号？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're sending a signal down to the Quantum Realm?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.81,0:12:10.81,Default,,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.98,0:12:13.19,Default,,0,0,0,,-马上关掉 -珍妮…\N{\fnArial\fs30}-Shut it down now. -Janet...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.35,0:12:15.06,Default,,0,0,0,,-为什么要关掉… -怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}-Why would we shut it... -What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.23,0:12:16.32,Default,,0,0,0,,赶紧关掉！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to turn it off!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.48,0:12:18.03,Default,,0,0,0,,别激动 告诉我们怎么了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop and tell us what's wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.57,0:12:22.78,Default,,0,0,0,,珍妮？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Janet?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.08,0:12:28.49,Default,,0,0,0,,有些事我早该告诉…\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's something I should have told...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.78,0:13:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.62,0:13:07.57,Default,,0,0,0,,不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.74,0:13:09.24,Default,,0,0,0,,-不！ -妈妈！\N{\fnArial\fs30}-No! -Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.79,0:13:11.16,Default,,0,0,0,,不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.54,0:13:13.54,Default,,0,0,0,,见鬼！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.67,0:13:16.63,Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.95,0:13:49.95,Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.54,0:13:56.71,Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.90,0:14:22.90,Default,,0,0,0,,凯茜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cassie.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.45,0:14:29.45,Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.91,0:14:31.33,Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸 起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Dad. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.70,0:14:33.54,Default,,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.70,0:14:34.54,Default,,0,0,0,,你没事吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.70,0:14:35.83,Default,,0,0,0,,没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.93,0:14:53.31,Default,,0,0,0,,这儿是什么地方？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.41,0:15:12.41,Default,,0,0,0,,妈妈！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.83,0:15:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.20,0:15:16.91,Default,,0,0,0,,霍普 我在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hope. Over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.58,0:15:20.58,Default,,0,0,0,,你没事吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.58,0:15:23.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我们应该死了才对\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should be dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.00,0:15:25.00,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么还没死？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why aren't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.17,0:15:26.38,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.42,0:15:29.93,Default,,0,0,0,,这儿是我想的那地方吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are we where I think we are?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.68,0:15:32.30,Default,,0,0,0,,应该说是的 但…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would say yes...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.60,0:15:34.81,Default,,0,0,0,,上次来时不是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it wasn't like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.97,0:15:36.18,Default,,0,0,0,,珍妮！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Janet!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.60,0:15:37.60,Default,,0,0,0,,妈妈！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.73,0:15:39.73,Default,,0,0,0,,珍妮！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Janet!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.40,0:15:42.40,Default,,0,0,0,,妈妈！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.45,0:15:56.62,Default,,0,0,0,,待在这儿别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do not move.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.18,0:16:16.68,Default,,0,0,0,,得找到斯科特和凯茜\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to find Scott and Cassie.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.89,0:16:18.89,Default,,0,0,0,,马上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.48,0:16:24.86,Default,,0,0,0,,霍普？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hope? Hope?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.02,0:16:26.94,Default,,0,0,0,,汉克？能听见吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hank? Can you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.82,0:16:30.53,Default,,0,0,0,,-有人能听见吗？ -天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}-Can anyone hear me? -Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.07,0:16:33.07,Default,,0,0,0,,-没事 -现在怎么办？\N{\fnArial\fs30}-It's okay. -What are we gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.24,0:16:35.03,Default,,0,0,0,,没事 我们没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay. It's okay. We're okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.20,0:16:36.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我们没事 会没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're okay. It's gonna be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.41,0:16:37.49,Default,,0,0,0,,你说太多遍"没事"了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're saying "okay" too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.66,0:16:39.83,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 没事 我就是陈述事实\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. All right. Okay. Well, it's 'cause we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.00,0:16:40.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我们没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.04,0:16:42.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我们很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.21,0:16:44.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我们会找到他们 然后回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, we're gonna find them, and we're gonna go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.67,0:16:46.84,Default,,0,0,0,,趁现在看看风景\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the meantime, look around.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.00,0:16:48.21,Default,,0,0,0,,这儿多美\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.38,0:16:49.63,Default,,0,0,0,,这儿就像野外\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right? We're outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.42,0:16:52.51,Default,,0,0,0,,就当是露营 我们喜欢露营\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like we're camping. We love camping.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.67,0:16:53.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我们从来没露营过\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've never been camping.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.30,0:16:56.68,Default,,0,0,0,,但我们一直都说要去\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we've always talked about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.48,0:17:03.23,Default,,0,0,0,,那个太阳是在动吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that sun moving?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.20,0:17:15.20,Default,,0,0,0,,退后！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get back!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.95,0:17:20.83,Default,,0,0,0,,老天！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.91,0:17:23.41,Default,,0,0,0,,这好像不是太阳！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think this is a sun!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.25,0:17:25.25,Default,,0,0,0,,没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.54,0:17:27.46,Default,,0,0,0,,-爸爸！ -没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}-Dad! -Honey, it's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.63,0:17:28.63,Default,,0,0,0,,问题不大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.43,0:17:38.93,Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸 天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad. Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.10,0:17:40.10,Default,,0,0,0,,真诡异\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.48,0:17:46.48,Default,,0,0,0,,快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.01,0:18:18.39,Default,,0,0,0,,量子领域里还有量子住民？\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's Quantum people in the Quantum Realm?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.55,0:18:19.55,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.39,0:18:21.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我也是第一次知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't know that either.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.06,0:18:27.31,Default,,0,0,0,,刚才那是什么 妈妈？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was that back there, Mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.48,0:18:29.10,Default,,0,0,0,,那艘飞船在找什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was that ship looking for?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.27,0:18:30.98,Default,,0,0,0,,小点声\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep your voice down.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.15,0:18:33.23,Default,,0,0,0,,你还说这儿什么都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said there was nothing down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.40,0:18:34.74,Default,,0,0,0,,你为什么不告诉我们这里的事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why didn't you tell us about all of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.90,0:18:36.53,Default,,0,0,0,,霍普 我以后会解释的 但现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hope, I will explain everything, but right now...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.70,0:18:38.53,Default,,0,0,0,,-拜托你相信我就好 -你要我怎么相信你！\N{\fnArial\fs30}-I just need you to trust me. -Then make me trust you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.70,0:18:41.24,Default,,0,0,0,,大家都冷静点 有话好好说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's just calm down, all right? We can talk about this...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.41,0:18:43.49,Default,,0,0,0,,现在没时间说话了 亨利\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't have time to talk, Henry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.66,0:18:44.87,Default,,0,0,0,,你必须告诉我们到底…\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you need to tell us what's...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.04,0:18:47.41,Default,,0,0,0,,你为什么不听话？我叫你别靠近这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why didn't you listen? I told you to stay away from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.17,0:18:50.33,Default,,0,0,0,,珍妮 都是我的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Janet, I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.17,0:18:53.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我应该告诉你我们的研究 我没想到…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should have told you what we were doing. I had no idea...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.96,0:18:54.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道 这事…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know. It's...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.09,0:18:57.30,Default,,0,0,0,,回头再谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll talk later.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.47,0:18:59.26,Default,,0,0,0,,现在我们要一起行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right now, we stick together...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.09,0:19:01.60,Default,,0,0,0,,找到斯科特和凯茜\N{\fnArial\fs30}we find Scott and Cassie...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.35,0:19:03.85,Default,,0,0,0,,然后回家 好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we go home. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.26,0:19:05.35,Default,,0,0,0,,-好吗？ -好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}-Okay? -Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.52,0:19:06.52,Default,,0,0,0,,-好的 -很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}-Okay. -Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.68,0:19:07.68,Default,,0,0,0,,跟紧了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay close.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.11,0:19:16.44,Default,,0,0,0,,太不可思议了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.15,0:19:19.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我研究量子领域这么多年\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've studied the Quantum Realm for years.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.70,0:19:22.99,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么从没看到过这些？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why didn't I see any of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.62,0:19:25.54,Default,,0,0,0,,你能看到的地方还不够深\N{\fnArial\fs30}You weren't able to look deep enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.70,0:19:28.16,Default,,0,0,0,,还没穿过虚空和亚原子系统\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not through the Void and Subatomica.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.50,0:19:31.25,Default,,0,0,0,,这儿有许多个世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are worlds here...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.42,0:19:33.13,Default,,0,0,0,,世界之中还有世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}worlds within worlds.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.38,0:19:37.88,Default,,0,0,0,,这里超脱于时间与空间之外\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a place outside time and space.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.76,0:19:41.84,Default,,0,0,0,,是一个不为人知的神秘宇宙\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a secret universe...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.18,0:19:43.80,Default,,0,0,0,,隐藏在我们的世界下\N{\fnArial\fs30}beneath ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.08,0:20:06.87,Default,,0,0,0,,放开我！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, get your hands off me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.83,0:20:14.84,Default,,0,0,0,,凯茜？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cassie?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.59,0:20:18.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我女儿呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's my daughter?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.67,0:20:21.80,Default,,0,0,0,,她在哪儿？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.89,0:20:23.89,Default,,0,0,0,,凯茜？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cassie?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.85,0:20:28.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我女儿在哪儿？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's my daughter?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.48,0:20:33.48,Default,,0,0,0,,凯茜！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cassie!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.15,0:20:37.15,Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.98,0:20:38.98,Default,,0,0,0,,凯茜！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cassie!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.57,0:20:41.11,Default,,0,0,0,,把悟汁喝了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drink the ooze.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.32,0:20:43.53,Default,,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.64,0:21:06.85,Default,,0,0,0,,交给我就行\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll handle this.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.19,0:21:22.11,Default,,0,0,0,,妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.96,0:22:18.13,Default,,0,0,0,,感情好就捅一刀吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was that a good stab?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.71,0:22:20.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我搞到车了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got us a ride.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.27,0:22:40.40,Default,,0,0,0,,他很亲人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's friendly.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.90,0:22:42.40,Default,,0,0,0,,这车够别致的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quite a ride.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.57,0:22:45.49,Default,,0,0,0,,你可是第一个骑着蚂蚁到处飞的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Says the man who invented flying on the back of an ant.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.65,0:22:46.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我喜欢蚂蚁\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like ants.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.74,0:22:49.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我也喜欢你这一点 穿上\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I love that you love them. Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.87,0:22:52.08,Default,,0,0,0,,方便混进当地人里\N{\fnArial\fs30}These will help us blend in.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.83,0:22:55.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要坐这东西去哪儿？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where exactly are we going on this?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.91,0:22:57.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我有个老朋友住得离这儿不远\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not too far from an old friend of mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.83,0:22:59.71,Default,,0,0,0,,想知道斯科特和凯茜的下落\N{\fnArial\fs30}If anyone's heard where Scott and Cassie are...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.67,0:23:01.79,Default,,0,0,0,,就得找他\N{\fnArial\fs30}it'll be him.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.67,0:23:03.67,Default,,0,0,0,,您先请\N{\fnArial\fs30}After you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.42,0:23:06.80,Default,,0,0,0,,上车吧 蚁人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Saddle up, Ant-Man.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.26,0:23:14.26,Default,,0,0,0,,放开我！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me go! Let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.44,0:23:26.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我听不懂你在说什么！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what you're saying!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.74,0:23:28.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我听不懂你…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what you...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.76,0:23:48.84,Default,,0,0,0,,不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.43,0:24:00.06,Default,,0,0,0,,喝悟汁！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drink the ooze!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.23,0:24:01.56,Default,,0,0,0,,喝悟汁！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drink the ooze!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.94,0:24:03.61,Default,,0,0,0,,喝悟汁！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drink the ooze!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.77,0:24:05.11,Default,,0,0,0,,喝悟汁！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drink the ooze!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.86,0:24:07.78,Default,,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.94,0:24:08.86,Default,,0,0,0,,嗨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi. Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.03,0:24:10.45,Default,,0,0,0,,你把悟汁喝下去了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you drink the ooze?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.11,0:24:13.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我怎么能听懂你说话？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why can I understand you?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.70,0:24:14.66,Default,,0,0,0,,太好了 悟汁起效了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great. That's the ooze.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.83,0:24:16.70,Default,,0,0,0,,大伙儿 起效了！悟汁起效了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, everybody, it worked! Ooze worked!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.46,0:24:21.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我们最终会成为朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can finally be friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.92,0:24:23.17,Default,,0,0,0,,嗨 我叫维布\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi. I am Veb.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.33,0:24:24.29,Default,,0,0,0,,你刚喝了我的汁\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just drank me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.46,0:24:25.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我刚…什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did... What?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.84,0:24:26.96,Default,,0,0,0,,要不要再喝点悟汁？来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you need some more ooze? Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.13,0:24:29.05,Default,,0,0,0,,-我帮你灌进这个洞洞… -不用了\N{\fnArial\fs30}-I can pour some ooze into your hole... -No, I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.21,0:24:30.76,Default,,0,0,0,,-不用了 -哇哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}-I'm okay. I'm okay. -Oh, wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.92,0:24:32.34,Default,,0,0,0,,好大一个洞\N{\fnArial\fs30}A big hole.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.51,0:24:34.18,Default,,0,0,0,,你身上有几个洞洞？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many holes do you have?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.89,0:24:36.18,Default,,0,0,0,,不好意思 这属于隐私吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. Is that a personal question?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.35,0:24:37.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我一个洞洞也没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't have any holes.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.10,0:24:40.14,Default,,0,0,0,,他叫斯科特·朗\N{\fnArial\fs30}His name is Scott Lang.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.27,0:24:42.56,Default,,0,0,0,,他有七个洞洞\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has seven holes.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.48,0:24:48.57,Default,,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.73,0:24:50.49,Default,,0,0,0,,你是怎么知道的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.65,0:24:52.65,Default,,0,0,0,,他叫夸兹 有心灵感应\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's Quaz. He's a telepath.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.95,0:24:56.03,Default,,0,0,0,,你会读心术？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can read minds?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.20,0:24:59.29,Default,,0,0,0,,对 我真心希望我不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, and I really wish I couldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.45,0:25:02.46,Default,,0,0,0,,大家内心都好恶心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone is disgusting.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.33,0:25:06.29,Default,,0,0,0,,-请你别想那种事好吗？ -抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}-Could you please stop thinking that? -Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.21,0:25:08.67,Default,,0,0,0,,-拜托你别这样 -别想？\N{\fnArial\fs30}-Please, stop. -Thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.71,0:25:11.17,Default,,0,0,0,,-别想那种事 -我不想\N{\fnArial\fs30}-Thinking that. -I'm trying.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.09,0:25:14.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我看你挺想的 而且我也觉得你长得很怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, not very hard. And I think you look weird too.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.72,0:25:16.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我没觉得你怪 我觉得你很酷\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think you look weird. I think you look really cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.39,0:25:17.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我也想脑袋冒红光\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish my head glowed.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.72,0:25:19.72,Default,,0,0,0,,不 你不想\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, you don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.89,0:25:22.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道 我一紧张就管不住嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know I don't. I'm nervous, okay? And it just came out.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.48,0:25:23.35,Default,,0,0,0,,你来这儿干什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.52,0:25:25.44,Default,,0,0,0,,-你是间谍吗？ -什么？不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}-Are you a spy? -What? No. No, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.60,0:25:26.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我们应该拷问他\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should torture him.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.73,0:25:27.65,Default,,0,0,0,,朋友们 别紧张\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys. No, it's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.81,0:25:30.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不是间谍 他是我爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not spies. He's my dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.07,0:25:34.07,Default,,0,0,0,,-谢谢 -不客气\N{\fnArial\fs30}-Thank you. -Welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.49,0:25:38.20,Default,,0,0,0,,那旧金山是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then who is San Francisco?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.37,0:25:39.91,Default,,0,0,0,,-那是我们来的地方 -是个地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}-It's where we're from. -It's a place.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.08,0:25:41.04,Default,,0,0,0,,那地球又是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then what's Earth?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.20,0:25:42.04,Default,,0,0,0,,也是我们来的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's also where we're from.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.20,0:25:43.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我们应该拷问他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should torture them.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.37,0:25:45.50,Default,,0,0,0,,你干嘛总想拷问别人？明明有别的办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you always trying to torture people? We have other options.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.67,0:25:48.46,Default,,0,0,0,,你的洞洞会流东西吗？比如乳汁 果汁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do things come out of your holes, like milk, juice...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.63,0:25:51.09,Default,,0,0,0,,维布 别再好奇他的洞洞了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Veb, stop asking about his holes.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.26,0:25:52.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我们自己人也有洞洞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some of us have holes.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.46,0:25:53.88,Default,,0,0,0,,你们到底是来干嘛的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.05,0:25:55.72,Default,,0,0,0,,究竟是从哪儿来的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you from?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.34,0:25:57.68,Default,,0,0,0,,-冷静 -从上面来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}-Okay. -Up there. Up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.85,0:26:00.81,Default,,0,0,0,,-这地方上面有另一个宇宙 -从地球 大号的地球\N{\fnArial\fs30}-See, above this, it's a different universe. -The Earth. Big Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.97,0:26:03.06,Default,,0,0,0,,-还是同一个宇宙 但是更大 -这儿也是地球 但是个很小的地球\N{\fnArial\fs30}-It's the same universe, but it's bigger. -This is Earth, but it's a very small Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.23,0:26:05.06,Default,,0,0,0,,-有时候是这样 -我会变大变小\N{\fnArial\fs30}-Sometimes, I guess. -I get big. I shrink.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.23,0:26:07.10,Default,,0,0,0,,-就好比… -我还写了本书讲这事\N{\fnArial\fs30}-And it's like... -But I wrote a book about it, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.27,0:26:08.15,Default,,0,0,0,,-又来了 -这儿是量子领域\N{\fnArial\fs30}-I don't know. -This is the Quantum Realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.31,0:26:09.52,Default,,0,0,0,,你必须缩小才能进入量子领域\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to shrink to get in the Quantum Realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.69,0:26:11.48,Default,,0,0,0,,-我们缩小了 现在我们很小很小 -我们来的地方更大\N{\fnArial\fs30}-We shrunk. Right now, we're really small. -It's bigger where we're from.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.65,0:26:13.44,Default,,0,0,0,,-我们现在变小了 -那儿更大\N{\fnArial\fs30}-So, we're small right now. -It's bigger.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.11,0:26:19.24,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 他们说的是真话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, they're telling the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.41,0:26:20.28,Default,,0,0,0,,是真是假不重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.16,0:26:24.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你们是从上面来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You come from above.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.17,0:26:27.17,Default,,0,0,0,,跟他一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like him.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.17,0:26:31.30,Default,,0,0,0,,所以他一定在追捕你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, he is hunting you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.17,0:26:34.59,Default,,0,0,0,,把这儿夷为平地也在所不惜\N{\fnArial\fs30}He will burn the world to find you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.51,0:26:36.51,Default,,0,0,0,,谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.34,0:26:39.43,Default,,0,0,0,,征服者\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Conqueror.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.24,0:27:45.91,Default,,0,0,0,,这里居然有生物 还是智慧生物\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are beings down here. Intelligent beings.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.08,0:27:49.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我一直推测有这种可能 直到亲眼看见\N{\fnArial\fs30}I always theorized it was possible, but to be here...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.17,0:27:52.29,Default,,0,0,0,,一个亚原子宇宙\N{\fnArial\fs30}a subatomic universe.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.46,0:27:54.92,Default,,0,0,0,,这会颠覆我们对于生命的所有认知\N{\fnArial\fs30}This changes everything we know about life...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.09,0:27:57.51,Default,,0,0,0,,对于进化 我们在银河中的位置\N{\fnArial\fs30}evolution, our place in the galaxy...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.67,0:27:59.38,Default,,0,0,0,,天啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.88,0:28:01.43,Default,,0,0,0,,他长得好像西兰花\N{\fnArial\fs30}That guy looks like broccoli.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.85,0:28:12.15,Default,,0,0,0,,低调点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep your head down.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.28,0:29:05.28,Default,,0,0,0,,跟紧我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.71,0:29:19.71,Default,,0,0,0,,把这个喝了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drink those.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.42,0:29:21.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我去去就来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be right back.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.31,0:29:37.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我来找凯拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm here for Krylar.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.40,0:29:43.36,Default,,0,0,0,,是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.70,0:29:44.86,Default,,0,0,0,,别声张 你知道就行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's keep that between us.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.11,0:29:47.49,Default,,0,0,0,,还有凯拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Krylar.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.66,0:29:48.66,Default,,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.87,0:29:51.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我不懂你们的风土习俗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know your ways or customs...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.79,0:29:55.33,Default,,0,0,0,,有没有什么喝的能让我一醉方休？\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I assume that you have a beverage that can get me drunk?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.50,0:29:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,,当然有 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Absolutely, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.55,0:30:01.92,Default,,0,0,0,,美女为何独自买醉？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what's your story then?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.38,0:30:04.38,Default,,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}God.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.93,0:30:06.93,Default,,0,0,0,,滚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.34,0:30:08.35,Default,,0,0,0,,该走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's time.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.89,0:30:09.89,Default,,0,0,0,,跟我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.65,0:30:17.86,Default,,0,0,0,,这边请\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.53,0:30:25.86,Default,,0,0,0,,你跟这个人怎么认识的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How exactly do you know this guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.03,0:30:29.20,Default,,0,0,0,,他是我当自由战士时的老战友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Old freedom fighter friend of mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.37,0:30:31.37,Default,,0,0,0,,什么 你还当过自由战士？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, you were a freedom fighter?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.54,0:30:32.58,Default,,0,0,0,,或者说恐怖分子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or terrorist.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.74,0:30:34.79,Default,,0,0,0,,这要看你问谁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Depends on who you ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.96,0:30:38.33,Default,,0,0,0,,不过 相信我 他能帮我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, trust me, he can help.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.33,0:31:22.96,Default,,0,0,0,,珍妮·凡·戴恩？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Janet Van Dyne?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.76,0:31:26.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我还以为你死了呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you were dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.13,0:31:29.01,Default,,0,0,0,,好久不见 凯拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Been a long time, Krylar.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.18,0:31:32.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我现在的正式头衔是凯拉阁下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Officially, Lord Krylar now.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.60,0:31:34.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我真不想大家这么叫我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I fought like hell against that.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.47,0:31:37.10,Default,,0,0,0,,听起来太自命不凡了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It sounds so elitist.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.19,0:31:41.02,Default,,0,0,0,,你一定就是汉克\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have got to be Hank.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.52,0:31:44.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我听过好多你和你蚂蚁的故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've heard so much about you and your ants.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.11,0:31:47.28,Default,,0,0,0,,话说蚂蚁到底是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are ants anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.44,0:31:48.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我们这儿有吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do we have 'em down here?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.99,0:31:50.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得应该没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think so. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.66,0:31:52.78,Default,,0,0,0,,太可惜了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.99,0:31:54.99,Default,,0,0,0,,霍普\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.74,0:31:57.41,Default,,0,0,0,,你一定是霍普了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to be Hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.96,0:32:00.21,Default,,0,0,0,,她以前每天都说起你\N{\fnArial\fs30}She talked about you every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.37,0:32:01.71,Default,,0,0,0,,奇怪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's strange...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.29,0:32:04.04,Default,,0,0,0,,她从来没说起过你\N{\fnArial\fs30}she never said anything about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.59,0:32:08.67,Default,,0,0,0,,换了我也不会跟孩子说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think I would have told my kid either.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.68,0:32:11.18,Default,,0,0,0,,-太刺激了 -你真逗\N{\fnArial\fs30}-Wild stuff. -Funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.05,0:32:12.85,Default,,0,0,0,,有多刺激？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How wild?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.22,0:32:16.43,Default,,0,0,0,,非常刺激 亨利 真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very wild, Henry. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.10,0:32:21.10,Default,,0,0,0,,凯拉 我们需要你帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Krylar, we need your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.44,0:32:25.23,Default,,0,0,0,,珍妮 我们一起经历了那么多事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Janet, after all we've been through, together...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.52,0:32:26.48,Default,,0,0,0,,尽管开口\N{\fnArial\fs30}just ask me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.65,0:32:28.15,Default,,0,0,0,,要我怎么帮你？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me, how can I help?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.32,0:32:29.61,Default,,0,0,0,,但首先…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.78,0:32:32.82,Default,,0,0,0,,你们饿不饿？我快饿死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}is anyone starving? I'm starving.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.99,0:32:34.12,Default,,0,0,0,,小伙子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boys...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.87,0:32:35.87,Default,,0,0,0,,上菜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.88,0:32:45.25,Default,,0,0,0,,他们一无所知\N{\fnArial\fs30}They don't know anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.71,0:32:48.51,Default,,0,0,0,,什么都不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}About... anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.67,0:32:49.67,Default,,0,0,0,,那就送他们离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then get them out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.63,0:32:52.68,Default,,0,0,0,,不好意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.84,0:32:54.97,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 他说得对 我不清楚你们的情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, he's right. I don't know what's going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.14,0:32:56.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我们只想找到家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're just trying to find our family.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.68,0:32:57.81,Default,,0,0,0,,你有地图吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have a map?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.97,0:32:59.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我们只想回…\N{\fnArial\fs30}All we wanna do is go...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.23,0:33:03.27,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 别开枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, wait. Don't shoot.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.44,0:33:04.56,Default,,0,0,0,,是自己人\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.48,0:33:07.86,Default,,0,0,0,,这房子是活的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that building alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.40,0:33:09.61,Default,,0,0,0,,你们的是死的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yours are dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.11,0:33:14.11,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 不好意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look. Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.28,0:33:15.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我们只想回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just wanna go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.95,0:33:22.04,Default,,0,0,0,,至少你们还有家可回\N{\fnArial\fs30}At least you still have a home.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.80,0:33:31.34,Default,,0,0,0,,这儿发生了什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened here?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.92,0:33:34.64,Default,,0,0,0,,征服者摧毁了我们的家园\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Conqueror burned our homes.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.39,0:33:37.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的文明\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our stories.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.01,0:33:41.31,Default,,0,0,0,,在我们同胞的尸骨堆上建起他的要塞\N{\fnArial\fs30}He built his citadel on the bones of our people.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.39,0:33:43.98,Default,,0,0,0,,有些人逃了出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some of us escaped...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.31,0:33:45.90,Default,,0,0,0,,路上又遇见其他人\N{\fnArial\fs30}found others on the run.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.90,0:33:48.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我们集结所有可用战力\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gathered who we could to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.23,0:33:50.78,Default,,0,0,0,,但还远远不够\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was never enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.07,0:33:53.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我很遗憾\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.15,0:33:55.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我们能帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can help.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.95,0:34:03.16,Default,,0,0,0,,-凯茜… -爸爸 你可是复仇者\N{\fnArial\fs30}-Cassie... -Dad, you're an Avenger.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.33,0:34:04.25,Default,,0,0,0,,他们需要帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}They need help.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.41,0:34:06.33,Default,,0,0,0,,不 我需要做的是带你回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. What I need to do is get you home.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.79,0:34:07.96,Default,,0,0,0,,你为什么不肯帮忙？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you wanna help?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.13,0:34:09.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我们根本不了解这个地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't know anything about this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.50,0:34:11.21,Default,,0,0,0,,都不知道这儿的时间是怎么流动的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I don't even know how time works down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.38,0:34:12.55,Default,,0,0,0,,上面的世界是过了十秒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have we been gone for 10 seconds?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.71,0:34:13.71,Default,,0,0,0,,还是已经过了十年？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or have we been gone for 10 years?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.88,0:34:15.01,Default,,0,0,0,,想想你妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think about your mom right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.17,0:34:17.34,Default,,0,0,0,,-你能想象她该有… -别拿妈妈当借口\N{\fnArial\fs30}-Can you imagine what she must be... -Don't use Mom as an excuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.51,0:34:19.60,Default,,0,0,0,,-你就是不在乎 -不 我在乎\N{\fnArial\fs30}-You just don't care. -No, I do care.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.76,0:34:21.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你想帮助别人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you wanna help. I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.60,0:34:23.39,Default,,0,0,0,,但这不是我们该打的仗\N{\fnArial\fs30}But this is not our fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.77,0:34:26.44,Default,,0,0,0,,坏事没落到你头上 不代表天下太平\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just 'cause it's not happening to you doesn't mean it's not happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.94,0:34:28.94,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.90,0:34:33.28,Default,,0,0,0,,看着我好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you look at me?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.57,0:34:37.07,Default,,0,0,0,,她对你很失望\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's disappointed in you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.24,0:34:38.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got that. Yeah. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.87,0:34:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,,不客气\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.87,0:34:40.95,Default,,0,0,0,,这事我们晚点再谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll talk about it later.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.12,0:34:42.79,Default,,0,0,0,,现在得先找到他们三个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right now, let's just find the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.29,0:34:45.21,Default,,0,0,0,,只有珍妮最了解这个地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one knows this place better than Janet.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.58,0:34:48.50,Default,,0,0,0,,你刚说什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.00,0:34:50.09,Default,,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.25,0:34:51.46,Default,,0,0,0,,那个名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}That name.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.59,0:34:54.13,Default,,0,0,0,,珍妮·凡·戴恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Janet Van Dyne.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.30,0:34:55.26,Default,,0,0,0,,她在哪儿？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.42,0:34:57.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我们也在找她 你认识她？\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what we're trying to find out. You know her?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.68,0:34:58.89,Default,,0,0,0,,认识\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know her.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.22,0:35:01.47,Default,,0,0,0,,她不该来这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}She shouldn't be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.39,0:35:05.23,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 麻烦来几杯醒酒水\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, bring a round of the chasers, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.89,0:35:06.94,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.10,0:35:10.19,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你们没喝过这个 那不建议尝试\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you haven't had this, don't try it...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.69,0:35:12.77,Default,,0,0,0,,它会颠覆你们的人生\N{\fnArial\fs30}unless you want to change your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.08,0:35:27.58,Default,,0,0,0,,凯拉 我们在找朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Krylar, we're looking for friends of ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.58,0:35:29.83,Default,,0,0,0,,两个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.00,0:35:31.29,Default,,0,0,0,,跟我们一样都是人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}Human, like us.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.46,0:35:33.09,Default,,0,0,0,,人类 就是这词\N{\fnArial\fs30}Human, that's the word.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.25,0:35:36.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我都忘了你们上面的人管自己叫什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Totally forgot what you call yourselves up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.51,0:35:37.51,Default,,0,0,0,,人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}Human.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.18,0:35:40.18,Default,,0,0,0,,你不是人类吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you not human?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.34,0:35:42.35,Default,,0,0,0,,不严格来说 我是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not technically, but yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.97,0:35:44.35,Default,,0,0,0,,在关键时刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the ways that matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.98,0:35:49.98,Default,,0,0,0,,不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.52,0:35:54.86,Default,,0,0,0,,让我们谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let us talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.82,0:36:02.07,Default,,0,0,0,,是什么风把你吹来了 珍妮？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what is it that brings you to us, Janet?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.49,0:36:05.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我没记错的话 当初是你要离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I remember correctly, you left.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.37,0:36:09.37,Default,,0,0,0,,丢下我们所有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You left all of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.04,0:36:11.25,Default,,0,0,0,,跟他一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}With him.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.79,0:36:14.75,Default,,0,0,0,,珍妮 他在说什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Janet, what is he talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.71,0:36:19.55,Default,,0,0,0,,你没跟他们说他的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't tell them about him.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.51,0:36:24.10,Default,,0,0,0,,你跟他们提过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you say anything...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.01,0:36:26.22,Default,,0,0,0,,你在这儿干的事吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}about what you did here?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.56,0:36:30.73,Default,,0,0,0,,有多少人因你而死？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many people died because of you?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.77,0:36:38.15,Default,,0,0,0,,你的家人知道你是什么人吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does your family even know who you are?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.82,0:36:42.99,Default,,0,0,0,,你妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your mommy...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.45,0:36:46.29,Default,,0,0,0,,充满秘密\N{\fnArial\fs30}is full of secrets.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.45,0:36:47.54,Default,,0,0,0,,你撒谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.70,0:36:48.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我撒谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}I lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.83,0:36:51.17,Default,,0,0,0,,还真不少\N{\fnArial\fs30}A lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.83,0:36:55.59,Default,,0,0,0,,但这件事上没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.38,0:36:58.67,Default,,0,0,0,,放他们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let them go.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.42,0:37:02.47,Default,,0,0,0,,他只想要我\N{\fnArial\fs30}He just wants me.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.63,0:37:04.01,Default,,0,0,0,,可你想保住他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you want them.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.39,0:37:06.97,Default,,0,0,0,,所以他们也得来\N{\fnArial\fs30}So they're coming too.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.22,0:37:11.27,Default,,0,0,0,,还有你那两个朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Along with those other friends of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.77,0:37:14.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我听到他们的消息了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I heard about them.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.69,0:37:16.90,Default,,0,0,0,,但他也听到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he did too.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.69,0:37:20.32,Default,,0,0,0,,已经派出了追捕者\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he sent the Hunter.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.86,0:37:22.49,Default,,0,0,0,,什么样的追捕者？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What kind of hunter?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.74,0:37:25.87,Default,,0,0,0,,既不是人也不是机器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not a man. Not a machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.03,0:37:29.91,Default,,0,0,0,,而是一种机械化生命体 专为…\N{\fnArial\fs30}A mechanized organism designed only...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.08,0:37:31.79,Default,,0,0,0,,杀戮而生\N{\fnArial\fs30}for killing.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.92,0:37:35.21,Default,,0,0,0,,他们在哪儿？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.38,0:37:36.67,Default,,0,0,0,,不清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}No clue.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.92,0:37:38.92,Default,,0,0,0,,死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.26,0:37:42.51,Default,,0,0,0,,估计死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Probably dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.48,0:37:59.02,Default,,0,0,0,,太遗憾了 这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is so sad when all of this...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.19,0:38:00.73,Default,,0,0,0,,本来可以避免 珍妮\N{\fnArial\fs30}could have been avoided, Janet.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.24,0:38:04.03,Default,,0,0,0,,他要什么给他就是了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just give him what he wants.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.24,0:38:08.70,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么会变成这样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.41,0:38:14.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我们并肩对抗过他\N{\fnArial\fs30}We fought against him.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.58,0:38:18.46,Default,,0,0,0,,他能让你不得不服\N{\fnArial\fs30}He can be very persuasive.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.75,0:38:22.05,Default,,0,0,0,,去见见他吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's pay him a visit.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.13,0:38:27.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我们结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think we're done here.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.45,0:38:46.74,Default,,0,0,0,,那艘飞船能带我们离开吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can that ship get us out of here?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.45,0:38:50.20,Default,,0,0,0,,掩护我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cover me?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.37,0:38:51.45,Default,,0,0,0,,一如既往\N{\fnArial\fs30}Always.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.98,0:39:24.48,Default,,0,0,0,,亨利 你去操纵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Henry, take the helm.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.49,0:39:26.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我来点火\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna hot-wire this thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.74,0:39:32.37,Default,,0,0,0,,操纵杆在哪儿？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are the controls?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.87,0:39:34.16,Default,,0,0,0,,那两坨就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those are the controls.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.83,0:39:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,,什么鬼？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.17,0:39:41.04,Default,,0,0,0,,你能行的 就当骑自行车\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll be great. It's like flying a bike.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.38,0:39:45.38,Default,,0,0,0,,这自行车是活的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is the bike alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.94,0:40:00.60,Default,,0,0,0,,手伸到底！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hands, all the way in!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.61,0:40:02.73,Default,,0,0,0,,像往火鸡里塞馅料\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like stuffing a turkey.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.70,0:40:12.82,Default,,0,0,0,,-不是吧 就他？ -他以前很有魅力\N{\fnArial\fs30}-Really, him? -He used to be charming.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.99,0:40:13.74,Default,,0,0,0,,就那家伙？\N{\fnArial\fs30}That guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.91,0:40:15.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我在这儿待了三十年 亨利\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was down here for 30 years, Henry.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.91,0:40:17.62,Default,,0,0,0,,-我有需求 -天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}-I had needs. -Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.79,0:40:19.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我理解 我也有需求\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I get it. I've got needs too.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.75,0:40:20.75,Default,,0,0,0,,饶了我吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.92,0:40:23.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我跟别人约过几顿饭\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had dinner with someone a few times.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.59,0:40:25.05,Default,,0,0,0,,她叫琳达\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her name was Linda.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.00,0:40:27.01,Default,,0,0,0,,最后没成\N{\fnArial\fs30}It didn't work out.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.17,0:40:28.42,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么没成？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What went wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.88,0:40:30.47,Default,,0,0,0,,因为她不是你 宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}She wasn't you, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.85,0:40:36.77,Default,,0,0,0,,-叫所有人上船 准备转移 -好\N{\fnArial\fs30}-Get everyone in the ships. We're leaving. -All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.93,0:40:38.73,Default,,0,0,0,,-左伦 -在\N{\fnArial\fs30}-And, Xolum. -Right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.89,0:40:41.10,Default,,0,0,0,,送他们走 越远越好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take them as far away from here as you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.27,0:40:42.31,Default,,0,0,0,,-为什么？ -什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}-Why? -What?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.48,0:40:45.65,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你们在找珍妮 那他一定在找你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you're looking for Janet, he's looking for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.12,0:40:55.87,Default,,0,0,0,,你把他们引到这儿来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You led them straight to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.62,0:40:57.74,Default,,0,0,0,,快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.50,0:40:59.83,Default,,0,0,0,,尽量多带些人走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take as many as you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.00,0:41:01.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我们拖住敌人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll hold them off.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.44,0:41:25.44,Default,,0,0,0,,快跑！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.07,0:41:28.48,Default,,0,0,0,,快点！快跑！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on! Hurry, hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.15,0:41:30.61,Default,,0,0,0,,得赶紧离开！\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta go! We gotta go!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.78,0:41:31.82,Default,,0,0,0,,快上船！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get on. Get on now!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.99,0:41:33.24,Default,,0,0,0,,得马上离开！\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to go now. Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.22,0:41:52.22,Default,,0,0,0,,天啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.98,0:42:11.32,Default,,0,0,0,,凯茜 快走！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cassie, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.53,0:42:19.83,Default,,0,0,0,,去避难所\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get to the sanctuary.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.58,0:42:21.66,Default,,0,0,0,,等我消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait for my message.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.83,0:42:24.08,Default,,0,0,0,,-维布 得走了 -不 等等！\N{\fnArial\fs30}-Veb, we're leaving. -No. No, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.25,0:42:26.29,Default,,0,0,0,,-快上去！ -我的朋友们\N{\fnArial\fs30}-Move! Move! -All my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.61,0:42:49.69,Default,,0,0,0,,交出旅行者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give up the travelers.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.86,0:42:51.15,Default,,0,0,0,,征服者会宽赦你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Conqueror will show you mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.32,0:42:52.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我领教过他的宽赦\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know his mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.33,0:43:07.42,Default,,0,0,0,,待在这儿 我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay here. I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.67,0:43:09.67,Default,,0,0,0,,凯茜？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cassie?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.38,0:43:12.38,Default,,0,0,0,,坏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.53,0:43:37.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我坦白 我有战衣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. I have a suit.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.53,0:43:38.95,Default,,0,0,0,,对 我发现了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I noticed.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.66,0:43:40.99,Default,,0,0,0,,-没事吧？ -没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}-You okay? -Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.66,0:43:43.99,Default,,0,0,0,,听好 借势发力 懂吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, momentum, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.16,0:43:46.08,Default,,0,0,0,,飞身一击 懂吗？ 一气呵成 飞身一击\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jump, tap, right? One move. Jump, tap.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.25,0:43:47.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道怎么做 爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know how to do it, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.50,0:43:48.50,Default,,0,0,0,,-你知道？真的吗？ -是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}-Do you? Really? -Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.67,0:43:49.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我看着可不像\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause it didn't look like it from my end.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.00,0:43:51.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我没掐准时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}I messed up on the timing.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.46,0:43:52.29,Default,,0,0,0,,飞身…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jump...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.93,0:43:58.80,Default,,0,0,0,,像这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.97,0:44:00.39,Default,,0,0,0,,看见我刚才的动作了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see what I did? You see what I did?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.97,0:44:02.60,Default,,0,0,0,,没有 你刚就这么点大\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. You're like this small.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.97,0:44:03.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我飞身一击了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I jumped and tapped.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.69,0:44:16.19,Default,,0,0,0,,詹托拉 得走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jentorra, we have to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.38,0:44:38.55,Default,,0,0,0,,上飞船！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get to the ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.47,0:45:29.18,Default,,0,0,0,,欢迎回到量子领域 斯科特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome back to the Quantum Realm, Scott.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.93,0:45:32.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我等这一刻很久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been waiting a long time for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.23,0:45:34.31,Default,,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.86,0:45:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,,有人在里面吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is someone in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.19,0:45:39.15,Default,,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.32,0:45:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我是你逃不开的宿命\N{\fnArial\fs30}The destiny you cannot escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.07,0:45:45.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的命运早已被绑在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our fates have always been forged together...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.49,0:45:49.37,Default,,0,0,0,,从我们相遇那天起\N{\fnArial\fs30}ever since that day we met.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.79,0:45:53.21,Default,,0,0,0,,斯科特·朗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scott Lang.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.37,0:45:54.46,Default,,0,0,0,,坏人快走开！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get away from us!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.63,0:45:56.17,Default,,0,0,0,,那天你将我重创\N{\fnArial\fs30}The day you broke me.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.34,0:46:01.22,Default,,0,0,0,,-把我打落到这里 -等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}-Banished me down here. -Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.55,0:46:04.55,Default,,0,0,0,,达伦？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Darren?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.35,0:46:07.85,Default,,0,0,0,,见到我意不意外？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Surprised to see me?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.77,0:46:10.85,Default,,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.02,0:46:12.14,Default,,0,0,0,,是那个蜜蜂男？\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the bee guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.60,0:46:14.35,Default,,0,0,0,,-是那个蜜蜂男？ -凯茜？\N{\fnArial\fs30}-It's the bee guy? -Cassie?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.52,0:46:16.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我差点没认出你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I almost didn't recognize you.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.11,0:46:18.73,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么活下来的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How are you not dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.90,0:46:20.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我变成了终极武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}I became the ultimate weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.07,0:46:24.15,Default,,0,0,0,,你这造型是终极武器？\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what this is?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.03,0:46:26.28,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 达伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, Darren.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.45,0:46:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,,达伦已经死了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Darren is dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.83,0:46:35.37,Default,,0,0,0,,这里只有魔多客！\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is only M.O.D.O.K.!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.54,0:46:38.54,Default,,0,0,0,,你已经无路可逃了 斯科特\N{\fnArial\fs30}And there's no place you can run, Scott.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.71,0:46:39.84,Default,,0,0,0,,逃不过我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.46,0:46:42.09,Default,,0,0,0,,更逃不出他的掌心\N{\fnArial\fs30}And not from him.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.13,0:46:45.30,Default,,0,0,0,,他是未来\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.05,0:46:47.18,Default,,0,0,0,,也是过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.93,0:46:51.22,Default,,0,0,0,,现在他需要的就是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now all he needs is you.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.52,0:46:58.65,Default,,0,0,0,,妈妈？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.11,0:47:00.82,Default,,0,0,0,,谁要抓斯科特和凯茜？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's after Scott and Cassie?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.69,0:47:04.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我们得去找他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to find them.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.24,0:47:06.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我得先办些其它事\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's something I have to do first.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.11,0:47:08.53,Default,,0,0,0,,他们可能会没命的！\N{\fnArial\fs30}They could be dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.70,0:47:10.16,Default,,0,0,0,,霍普 冷静\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hope, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.37,0:47:11.95,Default,,0,0,0,,你到现在还有事瞒着我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're still hiding things from us.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.12,0:47:14.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我是为了保护你们不受伤害\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am trying to protect you.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.00,0:47:16.00,Default,,0,0,0,,受什么伤害？\N{\fnArial\fs30}From what?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.63,0:47:20.50,Default,,0,0,0,,谁让你这么害怕？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you so afraid of?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.06,0:47:34.43,Default,,0,0,0,,你第三次进大牢吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Third time in jail?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.56,0:47:37.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我第四次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Four.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.40,0:47:48.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我们又相会了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And here we are again.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.45,0:47:51.03,Default,,0,0,0,,面对面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Face to face.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.62,0:47:55.04,Default,,0,0,0,,这一面\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a face.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.46,0:47:57.66,Default,,0,0,0,,真是好大一面\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a big face.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.83,0:47:59.42,Default,,0,0,0,,你为什么就剩个脑袋飘着？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you just a floating head?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.58,0:48:01.67,Default,,0,0,0,,要不你给我们讲讲 达伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you could walk us through this, Darren.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.84,0:48:04.76,Default,,0,0,0,,你把达伦丢在量子领域等死\N{\fnArial\fs30}You left Darren to die in the Quantum Realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.22,0:48:08.38,Default,,0,0,0,,但征服者发现了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the Conqueror found me.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.55,0:48:10.09,Default,,0,0,0,,赐我新生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rebuilt me.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.26,0:48:12.30,Default,,0,0,0,,将我打造成终极武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Made me the ultimate weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.97,0:48:15.77,Default,,0,0,0,,一个机械化生命体 专为杀戮…\N{\fnArial\fs30}A mechanized organism designed only for...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.93,0:48:16.93,Default,,0,0,0,,魔多客？\N{\fnArial\fs30}M.O.D.O.K.?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:19.02,0:48:21.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我懂了 是首字母缩写\N{\fnArial\fs30}I get it. It's an acronym.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.52,0:48:22.69,Default,,0,0,0,,是简称\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's an acronym.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.86,0:48:25.86,Default,,0,0,0,,机械化生命体 专为杀戮而生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mechanized organism designed only for killing.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.28,0:48:28.90,Default,,0,0,0,,应该简称魔多夫客\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, that's M.O.D.O.F.K.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.07,0:48:32.49,Default,,0,0,0,,-你一定以为再也见不到我了 -我才发现你的腿好像小宝宝\N{\fnArial\fs30}-I bet you thought you'd seen the last of me. -Just now noticing the baby legs.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.24,0:48:34.24,Default,,0,0,0,,才不像小宝宝\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're not baby legs.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.41,0:48:35.79,Default,,0,0,0,,你好像婴儿背带\N{\fnArial\fs30}A little bit like a Björn.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.95,0:48:37.29,Default,,0,0,0,,你以为自己很聪明是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think you're so smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.62,0:48:40.58,Default,,0,0,0,,斯科特·朗 你夺走了我的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scott Lang, the man who took everything from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.75,0:48:42.17,Default,,0,0,0,,偷走了我的人生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who stole my whole life.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.46,0:48:43.46,Default,,0,0,0,,但我报仇了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.92,0:48:46.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我抓到你们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got you here.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.76,0:48:48.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我发现了你的信号 凯茜\N{\fnArial\fs30}I found your signal, Cassie.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.92,0:48:51.51,Default,,0,0,0,,这事还得谢谢你 不然我不可能成功\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks for that, by the way. Couldn't have done it without you.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.76,0:48:56.77,Default,,0,0,0,,你们眼前这个人摆脱了束缚\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're looking at a man set free.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.77,0:49:01.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我在这里创造的成果多到你想不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've created so much more here than you could possibly imagine.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.60,0:49:05.23,Default,,0,0,0,,全都献给他\N{\fnArial\fs30}All for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.99,0:49:11.07,Default,,0,0,0,,被困在量子领域的不止我一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wasn't the only one stranded in the Quantum Realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.45,0:49:16.16,Default,,0,0,0,,这儿是什么地方？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.45,0:49:19.33,Default,,0,0,0,,他说他是一个旅行者\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said he was a traveler.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.62,0:49:22.54,Default,,0,0,0,,一名科学家 飞船偏航坠落到这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}A scientist who crashed off course.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.26,0:49:31.72,Default,,0,0,0,,他有一艘飞船\N{\fnArial\fs30}He had a ship...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.59,0:49:35.26,Default,,0,0,0,,是我从未见过的科技\N{\fnArial\fs30}beyond anything I had ever seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.85,0:49:38.97,Default,,0,0,0,,一艘能够穿梭多元宇宙的飞船\N{\fnArial\fs30}A ship that could travel the Multiverse.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.14,0:49:40.35,Default,,0,0,0,,多元宇宙？\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Multiverse?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.35,0:49:43.90,Default,,0,0,0,,你是说交替维度？\N{\fnArial\fs30}As in alternate dimensions?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:44.06,0:49:45.90,Default,,0,0,0,,平行现实？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Parallel realities?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.06,0:49:47.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我刚开始也不信\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't believe it at first.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.90,0:49:50.90,Default,,0,0,0,,但确实是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it's real.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.70,0:49:54.11,Default,,0,0,0,,就跟我们的推论一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just like we theorized.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.66,0:49:58.37,Default,,0,0,0,,这艘船能送我们回去吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can this take us home?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:00.45,0:50:01.75,Default,,0,0,0,,它能送你去任何地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}It can take you anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.93,0:50:22.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我从没见过像他那样的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd never met anyone like him.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:25.19,0:50:27.31,Default,,0,0,0,,他好像彻底…\N{\fnArial\fs30}He felt so...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.73,0:50:28.82,Default,,0,0,0,,迷失了\N{\fnArial\fs30}lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.48,0:50:31.74,Default,,0,0,0,,可能我们都是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess we both were.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.65,0:50:34.07,Default,,0,0,0,,但我们找到了出路\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we had a way out.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.24,0:50:38.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我们试了各种方法\N{\fnArial\fs30}We tried everything...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.62,0:50:41.41,Default,,0,0,0,,给飞船的动力核心充能\N{\fnArial\fs30}to recharge his ship's energy core.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:47.00,0:50:48.59,Default,,0,0,0,,都失败了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing worked.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:50.13,0:50:54.80,Default,,0,0,0,,但孤单了那么多年 能多个朋友我也知足了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But after so many years alone, it was nice to have a friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:56.05,0:50:57.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我骗了霍普\N{\fnArial\fs30}I lied to Hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:02.06,0:51:03.73,Default,,0,0,0,,跟她说我会回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told her I was coming home.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.86,0:51:09.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我仿佛能看见她站在门口\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can see her by the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.23,0:51:13.65,Default,,0,0,0,,等我回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Waiting for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.70,0:51:19.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我做的最后一件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the last thing I did...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.87,0:51:23.04,Default,,0,0,0,,就是骗了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}was lie to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:26.87,0:51:28.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我总以为还有很多时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just thought I'd have more time.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.76,0:51:35.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我可以给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can give that to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:37.18,0:51:38.18,Default,,0,0,0,,时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.10,0:51:43.43,Default,,0,0,0,,时间不像你们想的那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not what you think it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.73,0:51:49.15,Default,,0,0,0,,它是一个牢笼\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a cage.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.56,0:51:52.32,Default,,0,0,0,,会用尽一切办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it does everything it can...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.98,0:51:54.07,Default,,0,0,0,,打垮你\N{\fnArial\fs30}to break you.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.28,0:52:00.53,Default,,0,0,0,,直到你挣脱出来才发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not until you free yourself from it that you see...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:01.70,0:52:03.12,Default,,0,0,0,,它本质上\N{\fnArial\fs30}just how small...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.12,0:52:05.33,Default,,0,0,0,,是多么的渺小\N{\fnArial\fs30}it always was.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.13,0:52:13.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我们一定能离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're going to get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.26,0:52:17.76,Default,,0,0,0,,她打开门就会看见\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's gonna open the door...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.34,0:52:20.80,Default,,0,0,0,,你在门外\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you'll be there.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.43,0:52:26.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.19,0:52:33.02,Default,,0,0,0,,-干活吧 -好\N{\fnArial\fs30}-Let's get to work. -Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.15,0:52:39.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我们花了很长时间 终于成功了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It took ages, but we did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.66,0:52:43.03,Default,,0,0,0,,飞船起死回生了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We brought it back to life.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:45.16,0:52:46.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我们回家吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.21,0:52:53.09,Default,,0,0,0,,飞船是用神经驱动的\N{\fnArial\fs30}His ship was neurokinetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.25,0:52:55.71,Default,,0,0,0,,与他的思维相连\N{\fnArial\fs30}Connected to his thoughts.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:59.63,0:53:00.72,Default,,0,0,0,,触摸到飞船时\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I touched it...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.80,0:53:04.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我看见了他的内心\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw his mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:05.68,0:53:06.68,Default,,0,0,0,,感受到了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I felt...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.48,0:53:09.85,Default,,0,0,0,,他所做的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}what he had done.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.65,0:53:15.48,Default,,0,0,0,,一个又一个世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}Entire worlds...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.15,0:53:18.36,Default,,0,0,0,,一条又一条时间线\N{\fnArial\fs30}entire timelines.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.53,0:53:22.53,Default,,0,0,0,,化为乌有 好像从未存在过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gone, like they never even existed.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.97,0:53:41.97,Default,,0,0,0,,珍妮？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Janet?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.76,0:53:47.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我们可以走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.18,0:53:51.19,Default,,0,0,0,,马上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.19,0:53:57.82,Default,,0,0,0,,康是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who is Kang?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.16,0:54:04.57,Default,,0,0,0,,是我必须扮演的角色\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who I need to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:08.91,0:54:10.25,Default,,0,0,0,,他不是意外坠落\N{\fnArial\fs30}He didn't crash here.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.79,0:54:12.46,Default,,0,0,0,,而是被流放到这儿的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was exiled here.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.54,0:54:16.71,Default,,0,0,0,,独立于时间和空间之外\N{\fnArial\fs30}Outside space and time.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.92,0:54:19.55,Default,,0,0,0,,只有这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only place...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.46,0:54:22.09,Default,,0,0,0,,才困得住他\N{\fnArial\fs30}that could hold him.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.22,0:54:24.59,Default,,0,0,0,,被流放？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exiled?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.26,0:54:26.72,Default,,0,0,0,,被谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}By who?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.10,0:54:28.10,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.60,0:54:32.39,Default,,0,0,0,,但他们毁了他的飞船\N{\fnArial\fs30}But they sabotaged his ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.69,0:54:35.44,Default,,0,0,0,,把他困在了这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}And trapped him here.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.90,0:54:39.27,Default,,0,0,0,,结果因为我\N{\fnArial\fs30}And because of me...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:40.69,0:54:42.07,Default,,0,0,0,,他就要逃脱了\N{\fnArial\fs30}he was getting out.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.24,0:54:43.07,Default,,0,0,0,,珍妮？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Janet?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.11,0:54:47.41,Default,,0,0,0,,别靠近我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay away.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.04,0:54:54.71,Default,,0,0,0,,你救了我的命\N{\fnArial\fs30}You saved my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.05,0:55:01.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我向你保证过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I made a promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.35,0:55:09.97,Default,,0,0,0,,让我送你回家吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just let me take you home.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:11.77,0:55:12.81,Default,,0,0,0,,然后呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:14.98,0:55:16.73,Default,,0,0,0,,你打算干什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you going to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.12,0:55:29.41,Default,,0,0,0,,赢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Win.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.63,0:55:51.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我说过 时间不是你们想的那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you time isn't what you think.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:53.31,0:55:54.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我可以改变时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can make it...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.77,0:55:57.85,Default,,0,0,0,,让你从未离开过她\N{\fnArial\fs30}so you never left her.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.19,0:56:02.40,Default,,0,0,0,,霍普打开门就会看见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hope is going to open the door...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.82,0:56:05.15,Default,,0,0,0,,你在门外\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you'll be there.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:06.15,0:56:08.49,Default,,0,0,0,,你出去以后\N{\fnArial\fs30}And how many worlds will die...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.95,0:56:11.58,Default,,0,0,0,,会有多少个世界被毁灭？\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you get out?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:12.91,0:56:14.16,Default,,0,0,0,,你的不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:15.91,0:56:17.54,Default,,0,0,0,,她永远不会知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}She'll never know.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:22.29,0:56:24.84,Default,,0,0,0,,你不想再见到你女儿吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you want to see your daughter again?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.17,0:56:28.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我不能放你走\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't let you leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.18,0:56:33.18,Default,,0,0,0,,你凭什么觉得你能拦住我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do you think you can stop me?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.16,0:56:52.53,Default,,0,0,0,,把它给我 珍妮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give it to me, Janet.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.99,0:56:55.12,Default,,0,0,0,,给我！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give it to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.58,0:56:58.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我打不过他 他太强大了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I couldn't beat him. He was too powerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:59.41,0:57:00.42,Default,,0,0,0,,你做了什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.92,0:57:06.42,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起 霍普\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, Hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.80,0:57:09.97,Default,,0,0,0,,不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:37.20,0:57:38.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我炸开了动力核心\N{\fnArial\fs30}I blew up his core.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:39.12,0:57:41.29,Default,,0,0,0,,把他跟时间彻底隔绝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cut him off from time.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.71,0:57:44.63,Default,,0,0,0,,也把我们永远隔绝在了这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}And trapped us both down here forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:46.67,0:57:48.59,Default,,0,0,0,,但我还是给了他足够的力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I gave him back enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.76,0:57:50.38,Default,,0,0,0,,现在他取回了战衣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now that he had his suit back...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:50.55,0:57:53.93,Default,,0,0,0,,变回了他一直以来的角色\N{\fnArial\fs30}he became what he always was.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:54.85,0:57:56.51,Default,,0,0,0,,征服者\N{\fnArial\fs30}A conqueror.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.68,0:57:59.27,Default,,0,0,0,,他掌握的科技和武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's got weapons and technology...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:59.43,0:58:03.10,Default,,0,0,0,,再过几百年我们也望尘莫及\N{\fnArial\fs30}centuries beyond anything we can dream of.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:03.94,0:58:07.73,Default,,0,0,0,,他将他的牢笼变成了他的帝国\N{\fnArial\fs30}He took his prison and made it his empire.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:08.78,0:58:12.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我花了许多时间与他斗争\N{\fnArial\fs30}I spent years fighting him...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.20,0:58:14.78,Default,,0,0,0,,逃离追捕 四处躲藏\N{\fnArial\fs30}running from him, hiding from him.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:16.49,0:58:17.91,Default,,0,0,0,,后来你们救了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then you saved me.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:21.25,0:58:22.25,Default,,0,0,0,,带我回了家\N{\fnArial\fs30}You brought me home.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:24.17,0:58:25.21,Default,,0,0,0,,但我并不配拥有这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I didn't deserve it.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:27.00,0:58:30.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我放出了一头怪物在这儿横行\N{\fnArial\fs30}I unleashed a monster on this place...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:30.76,0:58:32.59,Default,,0,0,0,,然后逃跑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and ran away.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:33.01,0:58:36.43,Default,,0,0,0,,珍妮 这种事谁也想不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Janet, you couldn't have known.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:38.60,0:58:40.56,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起 一直没告诉你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry I never told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:41.64,0:58:43.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我太想忘掉这一切了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just wanted to forget.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.02,0:58:47.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我只想重新做回你的妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just wanted to be your mom again.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:52.74,0:58:55.70,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起 让你一个人承受了那么多\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so sorry you had to go through all of that alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:56.66,0:58:59.28,Default,,0,0,0,,但你现在不是一个人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you are not alone now.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:02.96,0:59:04.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我们一起打败他\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll stop him together.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:05.42,0:59:06.88,Default,,0,0,0,,他想夺回核心\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's after the core.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:07.96,0:59:10.38,Default,,0,0,0,,他需要皮姆粒子才能靠近核心\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he needs Pym Particles to reach it.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:10.55,0:59:13.92,Default,,0,0,0,,他抓到斯科特和凯茜就有皮姆粒子了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if he's got Scott and Cassie, he's got Pym Particles.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:14.09,0:59:15.93,Default,,0,0,0,,-还抢先了一步 -没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}-And a head start. -Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:16.09,0:59:17.72,Default,,0,0,0,,-得赶紧行动了 -霍普\N{\fnArial\fs30}-We gotta get out of here. -Hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:18.22,0:59:19.89,Default,,0,0,0,,决不能让他逃出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}He cannot get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:41.41,0:59:42.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你很有意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're an interesting man...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:46.58,0:59:48.00,Default,,0,0,0,,斯科特·朗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scott Lang.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:49.67,0:59:50.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know who you are...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.25,0:59:53.84,Default,,0,0,0,,但你犯了个大错\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you've made a big mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:54.46,0:59:55.51,Default,,0,0,0,,懂吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.47,0:59:57.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我可是复仇者\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm an Avenger.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:58.80,1:00:00.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我已经呼叫了其他复仇者\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've called the other Avengers...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:00.64,1:00:01.89,Default,,0,0,0,,你是复仇者？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're an Avenger?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:04.18,1:00:06.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我杀过你吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have I killed you before?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:07.02,1:00:08.02,Default,,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:08.85,1:00:10.77,Default,,0,0,0,,时间一长就记不清了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They all blur together after a while.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:13.23,1:00:14.65,Default,,0,0,0,,你不是那个拿锤子的吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not the one with the hammer?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:14.82,1:00:16.15,Default,,0,0,0,,那是索尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, that's Thor.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:18.11,1:00:19.11,Default,,0,0,0,,经常有人搞错\N{\fnArial\fs30}We get confused a lot.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:19.28,1:00:21.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我们身材差不多 你是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Similar body types. Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:23.91,1:00:25.04,Default,,0,0,0,,只是一个…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just a man...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:25.83,1:00:27.71,Default,,0,0,0,,失去了大把时间的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}who's lost a lot of time.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:27.87,1:00:29.04,Default,,0,0,0,,跟你一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like you.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:31.42,1:00:33.42,Default,,0,0,0,,但我们可以联手找回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we can help each other with that.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:35.21,1:00:37.42,Default,,0,0,0,,魔多客说你擅长偷盗\N{\fnArial\fs30}M.O.D.O.K. tells me you're a good thief.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:37.59,1:00:39.89,Default,,0,0,0,,没错 他偷了我的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, he stole something from me.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:41.55,1:00:43.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我在的时候 没你说话的份\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do not speak when I am in the room.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:51.81,1:00:54.27,Default,,0,0,0,,说真的 珍妮比你有用多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gotta say, Janet was a lot more helpful.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:54.98,1:00:56.32,Default,,0,0,0,,你也认识珍妮？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know Janet too?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:57.61,1:00:59.78,Default,,0,0,0,,这儿的人是不是都认识珍妮？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does everyone down here know Janet?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:01.07,1:01:02.70,Default,,0,0,0,,她没跟你们提过我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}She didn't tell you about me?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:07.29,1:01:08.96,Default,,0,0,0,,倒也不算意外\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess that's not a surprise.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:11.58,1:01:13.67,Default,,0,0,0,,珍妮偷了我的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Janet stole something from me.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.59,1:01:17.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我离开这儿的船票\N{\fnArial\fs30}My ticket out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:19.93,1:01:22.85,Default,,0,0,0,,只有你能帮我偷回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're the only one who can steal it back.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:23.22,1:01:24.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我为什么要帮你？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And why would I do that?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:24.93,1:01:27.43,Default,,0,0,0,,因为你们想离开这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because you want to get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.10,1:01:32.19,Default,,0,0,0,,而我必须离开这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I need to get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:34.52,1:01:36.36,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我清楚结局\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I know how it ends.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:36.82,1:01:38.24,Default,,0,0,0,,什么的结局？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How what ends?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.53,1:01:42.95,Default,,0,0,0,,万事万物\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of it.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:46.37,1:01:49.50,Default,,0,0,0,,时间于我不是一条直线\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't live in a straight line.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:52.25,1:01:53.79,Default,,0,0,0,,手握时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}And with time...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:54.75,1:01:55.88,Default,,0,0,0,,你很难\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's hard...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:56.34,1:01:58.05,Default,,0,0,0,,忍住不跳到结局\N{\fnArial\fs30}not to skip to the end.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:59.80,1:02:02.01,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你们想阻止接下来的灾难\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, if you want to stop what's coming...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:02.84,1:02:05.05,Default,,0,0,0,,相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}and trust me...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:05.22,1:02:06.47,Default,,0,0,0,,你们想\N{\fnArial\fs30}you do...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:08.77,1:02:10.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我是你们唯一的机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am the only shot you have.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:11.60,1:02:12.73,Default,,0,0,0,,什么灾难？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's coming?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:14.94,1:02:15.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:17.86,1:02:20.40,Default,,0,0,0,,很多个我\N{\fnArial\fs30}A lot of me.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:24.57,1:02:28.41,Default,,0,0,0,,他们把我流放到这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}They exiled me, down here.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:31.66,1:02:33.33,Default,,0,0,0,,因为他们怕我\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're afraid of me.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:39.30,1:02:42.51,Default,,0,0,0,,但只有我能让你们回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm the man who can get you home.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:52.89,1:02:54.39,Default,,0,0,0,,那就这么说定了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, do we have a deal?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:57.77,1:02:59.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得我们定不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I don't think we do.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:09.20,1:03:10.04,Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:10.20,1:03:12.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我帮你省点工夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me make this easy for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:12.66,1:03:14.37,Default,,0,0,0,,把我要的东西带来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will bring me what I need...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:14.54,1:03:16.83,Default,,0,0,0,,不然我就当面杀了你女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}or I will kill your daughter in front of you...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:17.00,1:03:19.09,Default,,0,0,0,,然后再让你重温那一刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}then make you relive that moment...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:19.25,1:03:22.55,Default,,0,0,0,,一遍又一遍 无穷无尽\N{\fnArial\fs30}over and over again in time, endlessly...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:22.71,1:03:25.18,Default,,0,0,0,,直到你求我杀了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}until you beg me to kill you.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:26.43,1:03:27.85,Default,,0,0,0,,听明白了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do we understand?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:31.60,1:03:32.60,Default,,0,0,0,,别动她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't do this.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:36.27,1:03:38.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我喜欢跟明白人打交道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a man who likes to be understood.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.90,1:03:42.90,Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:44.07,1:03:45.03,Default,,0,0,0,,别听他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't listen to him.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:47.82,1:03:48.66,Default,,0,0,0,,不！住手！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! No!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:48.82,1:03:49.87,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 这事可以商量\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, we can talk about this.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:50.33,1:03:51.45,Default,,0,0,0,,别照他说的做！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't do it!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:51.62,1:03:53.08,Default,,0,0,0,,你真的应该照我说的做\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really should do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:53.25,1:03:54.25,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.96,1:03:58.13,Default,,0,0,0,,放过我女儿 求你\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's my daughter, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:58.29,1:04:00.75,Default,,0,0,0,,你想让她活还是想让她死？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you want her to live, or do you want her to die?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.92,1:04:01.92,Default,,0,0,0,,求求你！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:02.09,1:04:03.34,Default,,0,0,0,,你觉得我在骗你？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think I'm lying?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:04.46,1:04:06.18,Default,,0,0,0,,你看我像是会骗人的人吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do I look like a liar to you?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:07.93,1:04:08.93,Default,,0,0,0,,住手！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:09.09,1:04:10.60,Default,,0,0,0,,-爸爸！ -我答应你\N{\fnArial\fs30}-Dad! -I'll do it. I'll do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:10.76,1:04:12.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我答应 放了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll do it. Just let her go.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:12.47,1:04:14.02,Default,,0,0,0,,放了她！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let her go. Let her go!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:24.94,1:04:26.20,Default,,0,0,0,,你真的差远了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're out of your league.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:28.24,1:04:29.24,Default,,0,0,0,,蚁人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ant-Man.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:35.50,1:04:37.29,Default,,0,0,0,,该庆幸你还有利用价值\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just be glad I need you.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:50.55,1:04:53.97,Default,,0,0,0,,不许再碰她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't touch her again.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:54.43,1:04:56.02,Default,,0,0,0,,那就把我要的东西带来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then give me what I need.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:57.77,1:04:59.02,Default,,0,0,0,,东西在哪儿？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:40.56,1:05:41.98,Default,,0,0,0,,那是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is that?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:42.15,1:05:44.52,Default,,0,0,0,,原本是多元宇宙飞船动力核心\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was a multiversal engine core.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:46.19,1:05:49.65,Default,,0,0,0,,有了它你就能在时空中任意穿梭\N{\fnArial\fs30}A power source that can take you anywhere in space and time.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:51.41,1:05:52.99,Default,,0,0,0,,后来被珍妮炸了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then Janet blew it up.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:57.33,1:05:58.66,Default,,0,0,0,,核心在那里面？\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's in that?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.83,1:06:00.71,Default,,0,0,0,,那就是核心\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is that.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:00.87,1:06:02.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我们得想办法进到中心\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we have to get to the center.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:03.75,1:06:05.17,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢告知\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's good to know.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:07.00,1:06:10.22,Default,,0,0,0,,你要缩小然后穿过暴风中心\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll have to shrink down and pass through the eye of the storm.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:10.38,1:06:13.01,Default,,0,0,0,,进去找到核心以后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once you're inside, find the core...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:13.18,1:06:14.89,Default,,0,0,0,,把它变回原来的大小\N{\fnArial\fs30}and size it back down.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:15.05,1:06:16.51,Default,,0,0,0,,它长什么样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does it look like?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:16.68,1:06:18.89,Default,,0,0,0,,要偷东西总得知道长什么样吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I steal something, I usually know what I'm stealing.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:19.06,1:06:20.68,Default,,0,0,0,,你见到就知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll know it when you see it.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:20.85,1:06:23.15,Default,,0,0,0,,快去快回别耽搁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get in and out as fast as you can.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:23.31,1:06:26.61,Default,,0,0,0,,在里面待久了 精神会逐渐崩溃\N{\fnArial\fs30}The longer you're in there, the more your mind will come undone.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:29.53,1:06:30.53,Default,,0,0,0,,抓紧时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Better hurry.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:31.74,1:06:32.70,Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:35.20,1:06:36.53,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:36.99,1:06:38.54,Default,,0,0,0,,都是我的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is all my fault.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:39.95,1:06:41.83,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, hey, hey.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:42.21,1:06:43.21,Default,,0,0,0,,不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:44.83,1:06:46.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我失败了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I messed up.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:46.71,1:06:47.54,Default,,0,0,0,,凯茜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cassie.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:48.50,1:06:50.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我整个人生都建立在失败上\N{\fnArial\fs30}My whole life happened because I messed up.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:52.17,1:06:54.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我唯一成功的事就是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only thing I didn't mess up is you.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:58.01,1:06:59.18,Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:59.89,1:07:00.85,Default,,0,0,0,,没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:01.02,1:07:02.14,Default,,0,0,0,,别担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:04.90,1:07:06.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我爱你 小花生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you, Peanut.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:07.56,1:07:09.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我也爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you too.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:53.49,1:07:55.15,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 我进来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. I'm in.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:58.45,1:08:00.45,Default,,0,0,0,,达伦 能听见吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Darren, can you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:00.62,1:08:01.54,Default,,0,0,0,,达伦？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Darren?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:02.74,1:08:03.75,Default,,0,0,0,,达伦？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Darren?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:06.21,1:08:08.00,Default,,0,0,0,,魔多客 能听见吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}M.O.D.O.K., can you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:08.17,1:08:09.25,Default,,0,0,0,,干嘛？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:09.63,1:08:11.21,Default,,0,0,0,,-我进来了 -好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}-I'm in. -Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.71,1:08:14.46,Default,,0,0,0,,好 接下来干嘛？有什么计划？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, so what do I do? What's the plan?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:15.97,1:08:17.13,Default,,0,0,0,,别死了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't die?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:18.39,1:08:20.76,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢 帮大忙了 魔多客\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks. Big help, M.O.D.O.K.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:20.93,1:08:22.10,Default,,0,0,0,,看见它了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you see it?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:23.56,1:08:24.72,Default,,0,0,0,,对 看见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. I see it.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:29.94,1:08:31.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我要进去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm heading in.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:34.74,1:08:35.65,Default,,0,0,0,,什么鬼？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:35.82,1:08:36.70,Default,,0,0,0,,什么鬼？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:36.86,1:08:37.70,Default,,0,0,0,,什么鬼？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:37.86,1:08:40.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我说过 斯科特 进去只是第一步\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you, Scott. Getting in was just the beginning.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:40.74,1:08:41.87,Default,,0,0,0,,你没说过\N{\fnArial\fs30}You never said that.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:42.03,1:08:43.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我为什么会看见另一个我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why am I looking at another me?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:43.45,1:08:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是另一个 你才是另一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not another me. You're another me.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:45.16,1:08:46.08,Default,,0,0,0,,你刚冒出来…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just came out...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:46.25,1:08:47.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我为什么会看见另一个我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why am I looking at another me?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:48.04,1:08:51.21,Default,,0,0,0,,那是你的另一种可能性\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're looking at the possibility of another you.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:51.38,1:08:53.13,Default,,0,0,0,,你进入了可能性风暴\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're in a Probability Storm.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:53.30,1:08:55.42,Default,,0,0,0,,这到底是什么意思？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does any of that mean?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:55.59,1:08:57.26,Default,,0,0,0,,-你不知道？ -我为什么会知道？\N{\fnArial\fs30}-You don't know? -Why would I know?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:57.42,1:08:58.34,Default,,0,0,0,,因为是你把我弄来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because you got me in here.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:58.51,1:08:59.72,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我是真的 对吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, I am the real one, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:59.89,1:09:00.80,Default,,0,0,0,,不 我没那么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. I didn't say that.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:02.35,1:09:03.60,Default,,0,0,0,,-什么鬼？ -什么鬼？\N{\fnArial\fs30}-What the hell? -What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:03.76,1:09:04.68,Default,,0,0,0,,-什么鬼？ -什么鬼？\N{\fnArial\fs30}-What the hell? -What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:04.85,1:09:05.89,Default,,0,0,0,,-等等 -什么鬼？\N{\fnArial\fs30}-Wait. Wait, wait. -What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:06.06,1:09:07.10,Default,,0,0,0,,什么鬼？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:08.23,1:09:09.19,Default,,0,0,0,,这儿是什么地方？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is this place?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:09.35,1:09:11.44,Default,,0,0,0,,你在可能性风暴里\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a Probability Storm.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:11.94,1:09:14.44,Default,,0,0,0,,你可能做的每个选择都同时存在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every choice you could make, existing all at once.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:14.61,1:09:16.03,Default,,0,0,0,,他说什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is he saying? What's he saying?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:16.40,1:09:18.61,Default,,0,0,0,,-他说什么？ -那里就像薛定谔的盒子\N{\fnArial\fs30}-What's he saying? -You're inside Schrödinger's box.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:18.78,1:09:19.78,Default,,0,0,0,,而你是那只猫\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're the cat.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:19.95,1:09:21.41,Default,,0,0,0,,-什么乱七八糟的 -我懂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}-That doesn't make sense. -Oh, I get it.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:21.57,1:09:23.28,Default,,0,0,0,,都别动！听见没？都别动！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody move! All right? Nobody move!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:23.45,1:09:25.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我们干嘛听你的？你压根都不是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why should we listen to you? You're not even the real one.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:25.74,1:09:26.79,Default,,0,0,0,,-什么鬼？ -我是真的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}-What the hell? -Am I real?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.95,1:09:27.83,Default,,0,0,0,,-我是真的吗？ -我是真的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}-Am I real? -Am I real?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:28.00,1:09:29.29,Default,,0,0,0,,-我是真的！ -什么鬼？\N{\fnArial\fs30}-I am the real one! -What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:29.46,1:09:31.38,Default,,0,0,0,,什么鬼 我才是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell. I'm the real one.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:31.54,1:09:33.04,Default,,0,0,0,,朋友们 别激动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys. Hey, relax.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:33.21,1:09:34.88,Default,,0,0,0,,冷静点 深呼吸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take it easy. Breathe.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.05,1:09:37.13,Default,,0,0,0,,会有办法的 大家一起想\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll figure this out. Together.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:37.30,1:09:38.30,Default,,0,0,0,,你是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:38.47,1:09:39.84,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么穿成这样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you dressed like that?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.80,1:09:42.30,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我在芭斯罗缤上班\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I work at Baskin-Robbins.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.47,1:09:44.22,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我的工服\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is my uniform.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:44.39,1:09:45.68,Default,,0,0,0,,这是正常人穿的衣服\N{\fnArial\fs30}These are normal clothes.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.85,1:09:47.14,Default,,0,0,0,,你们为什么穿成这样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you dressed like that?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:47.22,1:09:48.77,Default,,0,0,0,,-有冰激凌么？ -别吵了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}-Do you have ice cream? -Enough!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:48.93,1:09:49.98,Default,,0,0,0,,直接干！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's do this!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:58.15,1:09:59.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我们都死定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, we're all gonna die.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:02.03,1:10:03.03,Default,,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:03.66,1:10:04.87,Default,,0,0,0,,等等！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. Wait!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:05.03,1:10:06.12,Default,,0,0,0,,不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! No!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:06.66,1:10:08.75,Default,,0,0,0,,不！等等！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! Wait! No!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:08.91,1:10:10.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我收到斯科特的信号了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got a read on Scott.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:25.89,1:10:26.85,Default,,0,0,0,,别挡我的路\N{\fnArial\fs30}Out of the way!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:27.01,1:10:29.10,Default,,0,0,0,,-妈妈 这是什么情况？ -你干什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}-Mom! What is this? -What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:29.27,1:10:31.02,Default,,0,0,0,,别去看 她们只是可能性\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't look at them. They're just possibilities.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:32.31,1:10:33.60,Default,,0,0,0,,不是真的你\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're not you.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:33.94,1:10:35.90,Default,,0,0,0,,斯科特 你在哪儿？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scott, where are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:40.15,1:10:41.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我怎么会在这儿？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why am I here?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:42.15,1:10:43.99,Default,,0,0,0,,别担心 这次一定行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry. It'll work this time.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:44.16,1:10:45.95,Default,,0,0,0,,你想…等等 别去\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you... Wait, wait, no, no. Stop.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:46.12,1:10:48.62,Default,,0,0,0,,-停下！不！ -大家看我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}-Stop! No! -I got this, guys.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:54.00,1:10:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,交给我！我能行！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got this! I got it!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:00.42,1:11:01.63,Default,,0,0,0,,斯科特 你在哪儿？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scott, where are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:02.22,1:11:03.22,Default,,0,0,0,,斯科特！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scott!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:06.68,1:11:08.26,Default,,0,0,0,,你在哪儿 斯科特？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you, Scott?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:09.60,1:11:11.43,Default,,0,0,0,,-我不能呼吸了 -你勒我脖子了\N{\fnArial\fs30}-I can't breathe. -Ow, that's my neck.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:13.02,1:11:14.14,Default,,0,0,0,,别踢我！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop kicking me!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:16.81,1:11:18.40,Default,,0,0,0,,-我的背! -我们都要死了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}-My back! -We're all gonna die!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:19.57,1:11:20.57,Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:23.40,1:11:24.66,Default,,0,0,0,,快回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come back.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:25.41,1:11:26.57,Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:27.37,1:11:28.78,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你能听见\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you can hear me...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:29.37,1:11:31.87,Default,,0,0,0,,求求你回来 快回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}come back. Just come back.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:32.91,1:11:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,,-不要放弃 -加油\N{\fnArial\fs30}-Don't give up. -Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:35.33,1:11:37.25,Default,,0,0,0,,-爸爸 求你再回来一次 -加油\N{\fnArial\fs30}-Dad, just come back one more time. -Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:37.42,1:11:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,,-她需要我们 -拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}-She needs us. -Please.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:39.17,1:11:42.34,Default,,0,0,0,,-加油 -回来 -她需要我们 大家齐心协力\N{\fnArial\fs30}-Yes, come on. -Come back. -She needs us. Let's do it together.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:42.51,1:11:44.76,Default,,0,0,0,,-拉他上去 -拉住他\N{\fnArial\fs30}-Get him up! Get him up! -Grab him! Grab him!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:44.76,1:11:46.30,Default,,0,0,0,,加油\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:47.22,1:11:49.22,Default,,0,0,0,,-加油 托他上去！ -很好！\N{\fnArial\fs30}-Come on, lift him! -Yes!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:49.39,1:11:51.60,Default,,0,0,0,,-我托着你！去吧 -加油 就是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}-I got ya, I got ya! Go. -Come on. That's it.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:51.77,1:11:53.60,Default,,0,0,0,,-加油！ -推他一把！\N{\fnArial\fs30}-Come on! -Give him a boost! Give him a boost!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:55.81,1:11:58.31,Default,,0,0,0,,加油 为了凯茜！大家加油！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, we're doing it for Cassie! Fellas, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:58.48,1:12:00.19,Default,,0,0,0,,大家齐心协力！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone together!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:00.36,1:12:01.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你在干什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:02.15,1:12:03.69,Default,,0,0,0,,你是怎么做到的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How are you able to do that?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:03.86,1:12:04.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我来告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll tell you how.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:06.45,1:12:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我们有同一个目标\N{\fnArial\fs30}We all want the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:10.03,1:12:11.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我来了 凯茜\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm coming, Cassie.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:20.38,1:12:21.75,Default,,0,0,0,,去找她吧 哥儿们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go get her, pal.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:27.13,1:12:28.68,Default,,0,0,0,,大家加把劲！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:31.05,1:12:32.31,Default,,0,0,0,,加油！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:40.27,1:12:41.27,Default,,0,0,0,,加油 再靠近点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, closer.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:41.44,1:12:42.32,Default,,0,0,0,,再高点！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get him higher!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:42.48,1:12:44.15,Default,,0,0,0,,大家坚持住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hang on, guys, hang on.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:45.44,1:12:46.99,Default,,0,0,0,,小心 稳住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Careful. Steady, steady.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:50.03,1:12:51.83,Default,,0,0,0,,稳住 就是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Steady. That's it.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:51.99,1:12:52.99,Default,,0,0,0,,上吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.37,1:13:00.38,Default,,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:03.92,1:13:05.55,Default,,0,0,0,,-糟了 -怎么了？成功了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}-Oh no. -What happened? Did it work?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:05.71,1:13:07.42,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起 兄弟！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, buddy!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:07.59,1:13:09.34,Default,,0,0,0,,-不 -不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}-No. -No.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:19.44,1:13:21.44,Default,,0,0,0,,霍普 你是真的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hope, are you real?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:21.98,1:13:23.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm real.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:23.90,1:13:24.90,Default,,0,0,0,,那我们一起上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then let's do this.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:29.91,1:13:31.20,Default,,0,0,0,,准备好了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ready?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:31.37,1:13:32.37,Default,,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ready.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:18.41,1:14:19.45,Default,,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:19.62,1:14:20.71,Default,,0,0,0,,得赶紧带它离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta get that thing out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:20.87,1:14:21.71,Default,,0,0,0,,不行 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no. Wait.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:21.87,1:14:22.96,Default,,0,0,0,,凯茜在他手上\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's got Cassie.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.50,1:14:24.75,Default,,0,0,0,,-什么？ -斯科特\N{\fnArial\fs30}-What? -Scott.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:25.29,1:14:27.38,Default,,0,0,0,,-珍妮 -把东西给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}-Janet. -Give that to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:27.55,1:14:28.42,Default,,0,0,0,,-得赶紧走了 -不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}-We have to go now. -No.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:28.59,1:14:29.80,Default,,0,0,0,,凯茜在他手上\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's got Cassie.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:30.17,1:14:32.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我们会救她的 我保证一定会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will save her. I promise you we will save her...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:34.14,1:14:36.01,Default,,0,0,0,,你决不能把这个给他\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you cannot give that to him.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:36.43,1:14:37.64,Default,,0,0,0,,换我就不会信她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wouldn't trust her.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:41.56,1:14:43.35,Default,,0,0,0,,珍妮的心思…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Janet has a way of...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:46.44,1:14:47.86,Default,,0,0,0,,总是变来变去\N{\fnArial\fs30}changing her mind.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:54.70,1:14:57.20,Default,,0,0,0,,你好 小糖豆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Jellybean.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:03.37,1:15:04.46,Default,,0,0,0,,那么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:08.25,1:15:09.88,Default,,0,0,0,,你打算怎么做 斯科特？\N{\fnArial\fs30}what's it gonna be, Scott?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:13.47,1:15:15.72,Default,,0,0,0,,瞧瞧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, well.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:16.89,1:15:19.72,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是我曾经的好老师吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it isn't my old mentor.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:24.27,1:15:25.10,Default,,0,0,0,,嗨 汉克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, Hank.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:28.69,1:15:29.69,Default,,0,0,0,,达伦？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Darren?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:30.36,1:15:32.78,Default,,0,0,0,,没想到还会再见到你的徒弟…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Didn't expect to see your protégé again after all...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:32.95,1:15:34.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我的妈呀 达伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy shit, Darren.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:35.61,1:15:36.95,Default,,0,0,0,,你这是怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened to you?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:37.12,1:15:39.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我是终极武器！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm the ultimate weapon!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:50.21,1:15:51.84,Default,,0,0,0,,要我亲自动手吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do I need to take it?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:52.30,1:15:53.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我女儿在哪儿？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is my daughter?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:55.55,1:15:56.55,Default,,0,0,0,,斯科特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scott.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:57.89,1:15:58.89,Default,,0,0,0,,不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:59.81,1:16:02.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我们说好了的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We had a deal.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:02.64,1:16:04.02,Default,,0,0,0,,没有你 她也没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}She'll be fine without you.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:29.54,1:16:31.17,Default,,0,0,0,,永别了 汉克\N{\fnArial\fs30}So long, Hank.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:38.72,1:16:39.72,Default,,0,0,0,,亨利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Henry.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:46.89,1:16:49.19,Default,,0,0,0,,当初你把我丢在这儿等死\N{\fnArial\fs30}You left me right here to die.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:53.36,1:16:54.82,Default,,0,0,0,,这次轮到他们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's see how they do.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:55.63,1:17:57.09,Default,,0,0,0,,你看到了什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you see?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:05.85,1:18:09.18,Default,,0,0,0,,上次我们都没机会聊这事\N{\fnArial\fs30}We didn't really get a chance to talk about it last time.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:11.19,1:18:12.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我一直很想知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I always wondered.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:16.11,1:18:18.03,Default,,0,0,0,,你接触到我的内心时\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you touched my mind...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:29.50,1:18:31.21,Default,,0,0,0,,看到了什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}what did you see?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:32.04,1:18:33.29,Default,,0,0,0,,一个怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}A monster...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:34.75,1:18:36.21,Default,,0,0,0,,却自以为是神\N{\fnArial\fs30}who thinks he's a god.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:36.63,1:18:39.05,Default,,0,0,0,,等你也能像我一样看透时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you can see time the way I do...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:39.21,1:18:41.13,Default,,0,0,0,,你就没法视而不见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}you don't get to close your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:41.30,1:18:44.01,Default,,0,0,0,,这世上就只有你能看透吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're the only one who sees?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:44.18,1:18:48.89,Default,,0,0,0,,只有我看出来它崩坏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am the only one that can see it's broken.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:49.18,1:18:50.35,Default,,0,0,0,,是谁破坏的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And who broke it?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:52.85,1:18:54.02,Default,,0,0,0,,是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:55.23,1:18:58.23,Default,,0,0,0,,每一个世界的我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every version of me.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:59.40,1:19:00.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我的变体\N{\fnArial\fs30}My variants.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:01.57,1:19:02.95,Default,,0,0,0,,在多元宇宙中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Throughout the Multiverse.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:05.24,1:19:08.45,Default,,0,0,0,,像孩子一样玩弄时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Playing with time, like children.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:10.83,1:19:13.87,Default,,0,0,0,,但我看到了结局\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I saw how it ends.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:15.17,1:19:17.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我看到他们带来的混乱\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw their chaos...
Dialogue: 0,1:19:17.96,1:19:20.92,Default,,0,0,0,,蔓延到各个世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}spreading across realities.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:22.09,1:19:24.34,Default,,0,0,0,,宇宙相互碰撞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Universes colliding.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:25.80,1:19:27.05,Default,,0,0,0,,侵袭无休无止\N{\fnArial\fs30}Endless incursions.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:28.39,1:19:30.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我看到多元宇宙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw the Multiverse.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:31.52,1:19:32.94,Default,,0,0,0,,正在走向灭亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it was dying.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:34.65,1:19:35.98,Default,,0,0,0,,他们就是元凶\N{\fnArial\fs30}All because of them.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:37.48,1:19:39.32,Default,,0,0,0,,于是我出手接管了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, I took control.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:40.03,1:19:41.86,Default,,0,0,0,,你是说你发动了战争\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean you started a war.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:42.69,1:19:45.95,Default,,0,0,0,,现在你想把所有威胁到你的宇宙都消灭\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now you wanna wipe away any universe that's a threat to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:47.07,1:19:48.70,Default,,0,0,0,,只有怪物会这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what monsters do.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:48.87,1:19:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,,这是征服者的职责\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what conquerors do.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:52.12,1:19:54.96,Default,,0,0,0,,把崩坏的世界销毁\N{\fnArial\fs30}They burn the broken world.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:55.96,1:19:58.75,Default,,0,0,0,,然后创造一个新世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they make a new one.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:58.92,1:20:01.80,Default,,0,0,0,,你不是想拯救世界拯救生命\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't care about saving anything or anyone.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:03.92,1:20:06.26,Default,,0,0,0,,你只是想报仇 因为他们打败了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You only want revenge because they beat you.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:07.18,1:20:08.14,Default,,0,0,0,,因为你输了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because you lost.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:08.51,1:20:10.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我岂止是输了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have lost.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:12.02,1:20:16.14,Default,,0,0,0,,你根本想象不出我失去了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have no idea what I have lost.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:17.69,1:20:21.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我要把他们从所有时间线上抹杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I will burn them out of time...
Dialogue: 0,1:20:21.73,1:20:23.15,Default,,0,0,0,,让他们血债血偿\N{\fnArial\fs30}for what they've done to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:24.11,1:20:28.07,Default,,0,0,0,,你这么做会抹消整条整条的时间线\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll be wiping out entire timelines.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:28.78,1:20:31.91,Default,,0,0,0,,杀死不计其数的生命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Murdering trillions of people.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:33.33,1:20:35.83,Default,,0,0,0,,可惜那不重要 珍妮\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish that mattered, Janet.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:57.81,1:20:59.27,Default,,0,0,0,,天啊 我在干嘛？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God. What am I doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:10.07,1:21:11.24,Default,,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:15.45,1:21:16.37,Default,,0,0,0,,汉克！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hank!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:20.08,1:21:21.38,Default,,0,0,0,,这是你的蚂蚁吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are these your ants?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:22.04,1:21:23.13,Default,,0,0,0,,你养的那些？\N{\fnArial\fs30}From the ant farm?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:23.30,1:21:25.17,Default,,0,0,0,,对 斯科特 它们是我的蚂蚁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, Scott, they're my ants.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:25.55,1:21:26.97,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么找到它们的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you find them down here?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:28.55,1:21:31.14,Default,,0,0,0,,掉下来后 我一直收到奇怪的信号\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been picking up strange signals ever since we crashed.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:33.31,1:21:35.93,Default,,0,0,0,,起初我以为是出了故障\N{\fnArial\fs30}First I thought maybe it was a malfunction.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:36.10,1:21:37.68,Default,,0,0,0,,受到了干扰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some kind of interference.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:37.85,1:21:39.73,Default,,0,0,0,,这是什么声音？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is that?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:39.90,1:21:41.02,Default,,0,0,0,,但我错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it wasn't.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:42.40,1:21:43.61,Default,,0,0,0,,是蚂蚁\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was the ants.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:45.57,1:21:48.45,Default,,0,0,0,,一直在试着联系我\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were reaching out the whole time.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:49.91,1:21:53.37,Default,,0,0,0,,它们应该是穿过了某种时间膨胀区域\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apparently, they passed through some sort of time dilation.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:53.95,1:21:56.75,Default,,0,0,0,,在一天之内度过了数千年的岁月\N{\fnArial\fs30}They've lived thousands of years in a single day...
Dialogue: 0,1:21:57.33,1:22:00.33,Default,,0,0,0,,不断扩充知识 科学技术\N{\fnArial\fs30}expanding their knowledge, their science...
Dialogue: 0,1:22:00.62,1:22:03.50,Default,,0,0,0,,达到了我从未想过的先进水平\N{\fnArial\fs30}becoming more advanced than I could have ever thought.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:03.84,1:22:05.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我没找到它们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't find them.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:06.13,1:22:07.38,Default,,0,0,0,,是它们找到了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}They found me.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:09.47,1:22:11.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我就说它们很聪明\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you they were smart.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:13.55,1:22:18.56,Default,,0,0,0,,它们建立了一种类似技术主义的二级文明\N{\fnArial\fs30}They've already built something of a technocratic Class-Two civilization.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:18.85,1:22:21.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道社会主义这个词容易引起争议\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I know socialism is a charged word...
Dialogue: 0,1:22:21.90,1:22:24.77,Default,,0,0,0,,-但我们能从它们身上学到很多… -爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}-but we could learn a lot from these... -Dad.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:25.86,1:22:27.15,Default,,0,0,0,,对 它们是我的蚂蚁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, they're my ants.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:27.90,1:22:29.90,Default,,0,0,0,,蚂蚁永不言弃\N{\fnArial\fs30}And ants don't give up.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:30.07,1:22:31.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我不管他是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't care who this guy is.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:31.49,1:22:32.70,Default,,0,0,0,,不管他有什么能耐\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't care what he can do.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:32.87,1:22:33.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我要去救凯茜\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm getting Cassie.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:34.24,1:22:36.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我们怎么才能扭转劣势打败康？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, how do we even the odds against Kang?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:39.62,1:22:41.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我们想到了几个办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got some ideas.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:41.21,1:22:42.21,Default,,0,0,0,,什么办法？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you thinking?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:42.37,1:22:45.38,Default,,0,0,0,,引用某位大作家的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, as a great writer once said...
Dialogue: 0,1:22:46.34,1:22:48.59,Default,,0,0,0,,成长的空间永远都有\N{\fnArial\fs30}"There's always room to grow."
Dialogue: 0,1:22:50.97,1:22:52.05,Default,,0,0,0,,你看了我的书？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You read my book?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:52.76,1:22:56.14,Default,,0,0,0,,一句废话都没落下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every goddamn word.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:58.77,1:23:00.14,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧 该干活了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Let's go to work.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:13.07,1:23:14.91,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿！对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:15.07,1:23:16.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我是不是吓到你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was probably terrifying.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:17.08,1:23:18.37,Default,,0,0,0,,你来干什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:19.08,1:23:20.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我来救你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm rescuing you.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:20.62,1:23:21.62,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么救？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:23.21,1:23:24.83,Default,,0,0,0,,这是个好问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a good question.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:25.46,1:23:28.13,Default,,0,0,0,,这玩意儿有钥匙吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does this thing have like a key?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:28.30,1:23:30.30,Default,,0,0,0,,或是门卡 房卡之类的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or a card? Like a room key?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:30.46,1:23:31.67,Default,,0,0,0,,就是类似…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know, like a...
Dialogue: 0,1:23:33.63,1:23:34.64,Default,,0,0,0,,见鬼！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:42.35,1:23:43.35,Default,,0,0,0,,飞身一击\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jump and tap.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:52.36,1:23:53.40,Default,,0,0,0,,詹托拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jentorra.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:54.82,1:23:56.62,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起 连累你们吃苦头\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry I got your people hurt.
