Dialogue: 0,1:24:04.50,1:24:05.54,Default,,0,0,0,,厉害\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:05.71,1:24:06.88,Default,,0,0,0,,让他们也吃吃苦头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's hurt 'em back.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:08.09,1:24:09.29,Default,,0,0,0,,天 你太酷了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn, you're cool.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:10.21,1:24:11.17,Default,,0,0,0,,你有计划吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have a plan?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:11.34,1:24:12.59,Default,,0,0,0,,救你出去就是我的计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}Freeing you was basically my plan.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:13.72,1:24:14.80,Default,,0,0,0,,你有计划吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have a plan?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:14.97,1:24:17.01,Default,,0,0,0,,要通知外面那些还能战斗的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to get a message out to anyone who can still fight.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:17.68,1:24:19.35,Default,,0,0,0,,然后救出被关在下面牢房里的同胞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then free our people from the detention cells below...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:19.51,1:24:20.76,Default,,0,0,0,,从敌人内部发起反攻\N{\fnArial\fs30}and launch a counteroffensive from within.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:20.93,1:24:23.10,Default,,0,0,0,,很好 你有计划 要怎么通知外面的人？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you have a plan. So, how do we get a message out?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:23.27,1:24:24.23,Default,,0,0,0,,跟我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Follow me.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:24.39,1:24:25.89,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 太棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Great.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:30.27,1:24:33.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我在这里建起了一座帝国 珍妮\N{\fnArial\fs30}I built an empire down here, Janet.
