Dialogue: 0,1:25:10.44,1:25:11.69,Default,,0,0,0,,是行动铸成的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is forged.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:12.48,1:25:14.32,Default,,0,0,0,,今天我们向上进发\N{\fnArial\fs30}Today, we ascend.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:15.19,1:25:20.20,Default,,0,0,0,,从这座要塞出发 我将向那些把我流放的人复仇\N{\fnArial\fs30}From this fortress, I will take my revenge on those who banished me.
