Dialogue: 0,1:36:09.31,1:36:11.64,Default,,0,0,0,,-但我最想吃青柠 -是吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}-But I really want like a lime. -Right?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:11.81,1:36:13.85,Default,,0,0,0,,-就想吃柑橘类 很奇怪 我懂 -柑橘类\N{\fnArial\fs30}-Citrus. It's weird. I know. -Citrus.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:14.02,1:36:15.02,Default,,0,0,0,,这…\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's...
Dialogue: 0,1:36:25.86,1:36:27.32,Default,,0,0,0,,攻下主塔！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take the tower!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:58.94,1:37:00.19,Default,,0,0,0,,都结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's over.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:02.11,1:37:04.11,Default,,0,0,0,,你还是不明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}You still can't see it.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:06.11,1:37:08.99,Default,,0,0,0,,永远都不会结束\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's never over.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:25.73,1:38:27.49,Default,,0,0,0,,-我们得快离开 -不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}-We have to go, right now. -No.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:27.65,1:38:28.65,Default,,0,0,0,,-快点 -不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}-Come on. -No!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:28.82,1:38:29.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我明白 但必须得走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know, I know, but we have to go.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:30.07,1:38:31.45,Default,,0,0,0,,-不！ -快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}-No! -Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:21.71,1:39:22.92,Default,,0,0,0,,你这个混…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You son of a...
Dialogue: 0,1:39:26.00,1:39:27.50,Default,,0,0,0,,-天啊 -斯科特\N{\fnArial\fs30}-Oh, God. -Scott.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:27.80,1:39:28.80,Default,,0,0,0,,起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:33.55,1:39:36.18,Default,,0,0,0,,你们以为我第一次见这种事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think this is new to me?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:37.51,1:39:42.23,Default,,0,0,0,,你们知不知道我镇压过多少次叛乱？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know how many rebellions I have put down?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:43.94,1:39:45.40,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:45.56,1:39:49.07,Default,,0,0,0,,征服过多少个世界？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many worlds I've conquered?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:49.94,1:39:52.15,Default,,0,0,0,,干掉过多少个复仇者？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many Avengers I've killed?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:52.32,1:39:54.87,Default,,0,0,0,,就凭你们也妄想打败我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you think you can beat me?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:55.03,1:39:56.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我可是康！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am Kang!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:56.83,1:39:57.74,Default,,0,0,0,,你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You...
Dialogue: 0,1:39:58.79,1:40:01.04,Default,,0,0,0,,只配与蚂蚁为伍\N{\fnArial\fs30}You talk to ants.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:20.91,1:41:23.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我的名字叫达伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name is Darren...
Dialogue: 0,1:41:23.62,1:41:28.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是混蛋！\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I am not a dick!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:49.65,1:41:50.90,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉 我来晚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry I'm late.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:53.19,1:41:54.44,Default,,0,0,0,,蚂蚁太多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lotta ants.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:55.86,1:41:56.86,Default,,0,0,0,,这是你弄的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, is this you?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:58.99,1:42:00.45,Default,,0,0,0,,你点醒了我 凯茜\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were right about me, Cassie.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:01.74,1:42:02.74,Default,,0,0,0,,达伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Darren.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:04.54,1:42:05.54,Default,,0,0,0,,你还好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:08.29,1:42:09.54,Default,,0,0,0,,不太好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Probably not.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:10.88,1:42:12.54,Default,,0,0,0,,-达伦？ -嗨 霍普\N{\fnArial\fs30}-Darren? -Hi, Hope.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:13.50,1:42:15.01,Default,,0,0,0,,你剪头发了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You changed your hair.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:17.72,1:42:19.59,Default,,0,0,0,,这到底是怎么回事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell happened?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:20.34,1:42:21.18,Default,,0,0,0,,就是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. No...
Dialogue: 0,1:42:21.72,1:42:23.18,Default,,0,0,0,,说来话长 回头告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a whole thing. I'll tell you later.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:23.97,1:42:24.97,Default,,0,0,0,,你刚才…\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was...
Dialogue: 0,1:42:25.52,1:42:26.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道该说什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what to say.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:27.52,1:42:28.81,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢 斯科特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks, Scott.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:29.44,1:42:32.65,Default,,0,0,0,,你一直就像是我的亲兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}You always were a brother to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:34.78,1:42:35.78,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:43.66,1:42:44.74,Default,,0,0,0,,当然了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:58.88,1:43:00.55,Default,,0,0,0,,至少我是作为…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And at least I died...
Dialogue: 0,1:43:02.09,1:43:03.64,Default,,0,0,0,,复仇者死去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}an Avenger.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:06.89,1:43:07.93,Default,,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:08.98,1:43:09.85,Default,,0,0,0,,-没错 -对\N{\fnArial\fs30}-You did. -Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:10.73,1:43:11.73,Default,,0,0,0,,你入伙了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're in.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:28.33,1:43:29.96,Default,,0,0,0,,这一天发生了太多事\N{\fnArial\fs30}A lot has happened today.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:30.75,1:43:31.87,Default,,0,0,0,,-亨利？ -珍妮？\N{\fnArial\fs30}-Henry? -Janet?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:32.04,1:43:33.88,Default,,0,0,0,,-妈妈 你在哪儿？ -我在主塔\N{\fnArial\fs30}-Mom, where are you? -I'm in the tower.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:34.04,1:43:36.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我好像找到回去的机会了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I can give us one shot back.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:36.21,1:43:38.01,Default,,0,0,0,,不过得抓紧时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we don't have much time.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:38.21,1:43:39.84,Default,,0,0,0,,要想回去…\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we wanna go home...
Dialogue: 0,1:43:42.30,1:43:43.72,Default,,0,0,0,,现在就得走\N{\fnArial\fs30}we have to go now.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:44.34,1:43:45.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我们会收场的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll finish this.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:47.64,1:43:48.68,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:49.77,1:43:50.64,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:52.73,1:43:54.27,Default,,0,0,0,,快点！该走了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:54.44,1:43:55.65,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 祝你们好运\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:56.02,1:43:57.07,Default,,0,0,0,,保重 我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good luck. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:27.76,1:44:28.76,Default,,0,0,0,,谢了 老弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:31.10,1:44:32.10,Default,,0,0,0,,你成功了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did it.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:35.90,1:44:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我们回家吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go home.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:58.88,1:44:59.88,Default,,0,0,0,,斯科特人呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Scott?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:00.05,1:45:01.59,Default,,0,0,0,,他刚才就在我后面\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was right behind me.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:44.67,1:45:46.26,Default,,0,0,0,,你真不该多管闲事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should've looked the other way.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:46.43,1:45:49.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我就是管不住自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, never been great at that.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:57.06,1:45:58.52,Default,,0,0,0,,你休想离开这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're not getting out.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:09.11,1:46:10.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我要你记住\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to remember.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:12.03,1:46:13.58,Default,,0,0,0,,你本来是能回去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You could've gone home.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:28.72,1:46:30.76,Default,,0,0,0,,你本来能跟你女儿团聚\N{\fnArial\fs30}You could've seen your daughter again.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:44.53,1:46:45.94,Default,,0,0,0,,可你太相信自己能赢\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you thought you could win.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:59.33,1:47:00.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我不需要赢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't have to win.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:02.33,1:47:04.25,Default,,0,0,0,,只要你跟我一起输就行\N{\fnArial\fs30}We both just have to lose.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:55.35,1:47:56.72,Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:03.85,1:48:04.86,Default,,0,0,0,,在哪儿…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where... Where...
Dialogue: 0,1:48:05.15,1:48:06.23,Default,,0,0,0,,她在哪儿？她…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is she? Is she...
Dialogue: 0,1:48:06.40,1:48:07.90,Default,,0,0,0,,-她没事 -她在哪儿？\N{\fnArial\fs30}-No, she's okay. -Where is she?
Dialogue: 0,1:48:08.07,1:48:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,,她没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's okay. She's okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:09.86,1:48:11.32,Default,,0,0,0,,-斯科特 他们都没事 -她安全了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}-Scott, they're all okay. They're all okay. -She's safe?
Dialogue: 0,1:48:11.49,1:48:12.49,Default,,0,0,0,,你成功了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did it.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:12.65,1:48:13.66,Default,,0,0,0,,你做到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did it.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:17.08,1:48:18.99,Default,,0,0,0,,-对不起 -别\N{\fnArial\fs30}-Sorry. Sorry, sorry. -No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:19.16,1:48:20.58,Default,,0,0,0,,别放手\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, don't let go. Don't let go.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:21.21,1:48:22.37,Default,,0,0,0,,别放手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't let go.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:22.54,1:48:23.79,Default,,0,0,0,,永远都别放开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't ever let go.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:25.42,1:48:26.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我陪着你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got you.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:29.55,1:48:30.71,Default,,0,0,0,,你回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You came back.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:41.10,1:48:42.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我爱你 霍普\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you, Hope.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:45.06,1:48:46.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我爱你 斯科特\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you, Scott.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:00.26,1:50:01.60,Default,,0,0,0,,回家吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go home.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:04.27,1:50:05.48,Default,,0,0,0,,家是最棒的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Home's good.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:13.90,1:50:15.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我生活中有很多荒唐事\N{\fnArial\fs30}My life doesn't make sense.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:15.74,1:50:18.07,Default,,0,0,0,,有段时间我常常问自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}I used to ask myself a lot of questions about that.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:18.24,1:50:20.95,Default,,0,0,0,,"斯科特 你带着一家老小拯救了量子领域"\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Scott you just saved the Quantum Realm with your family...
Dialogue: 0,1:50:21.12,1:50:22.99,Default,,0,0,0,,"还喝了一个没有洞洞的家伙的汁"\N{\fnArial\fs30}"and drank a guy without holes.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:23.16,1:50:25.41,Default,,0,0,0,,"这种事怎么总发生在你身上？"\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Why does this kind of stuff keep happening to you?
Dialogue: 0,1:50:25.58,1:50:27.08,Default,,0,0,0,,"这太荒唐了"\N{\fnArial\fs30}"That doesn't make any sense."
Dialogue: 0,1:50:27.25,1:50:28.58,Default,,0,0,0,,话又说回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you know what?
Dialogue: 0,1:50:28.75,1:50:30.75,Default,,0,0,0,,谁规定生活必须合情合理？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who said life has to make sense?
Dialogue: 0,1:50:35.09,1:50:36.09,Default,,0,0,0,,鲁宾！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rubin!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:36.26,1:50:37.47,Default,,0,0,0,,你是那什么虫！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are the bug!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:38.72,1:50:41.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我以前搞错了 你是另外那只虫\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was wrong. Yeah. You are the other bug.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:41.39,1:50:42.68,Default,,0,0,0,,你是虫子侠\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the bug man.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:42.85,1:50:45.43,Default,,0,0,0,,一会儿变大 一会儿变小 就像一只大虫子！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You get big and get small like a big bug!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:46.10,1:50:48.73,Default,,0,0,0,,没错 我就是 要一杯咖啡 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're right. That's me. Just a coffee, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:48.89,1:50:49.90,Default,,0,0,0,,12块\N{\fnArial\fs30}Twelve dollar.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:51.73,1:50:52.77,Default,,0,0,0,,12块！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Twelve!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:52.94,1:50:55.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我想过要不要给这段经历画上句号\N{\fnArial\fs30}I used to wonder if this chapter in my life was over...
Dialogue: 0,1:50:55.65,1:50:58.82,Default,,0,0,0,,但凯茜提醒了我:"需要帮助的人无处不在"\N{\fnArial\fs30}but as Cassie reminded me, "There's always someone you can help."
Dialogue: 0,1:50:59.61,1:51:01.99,Default,,0,0,0,,为你重拾了做蛋糕的手艺\N{\fnArial\fs30}Came out of cake making retirement for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:02.16,1:51:03.74,Default,,0,0,0,,(生日快乐 凯茜)
Dialogue: 0,1:51:04.45,1:51:05.45,Default,,0,0,0,,哇哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:06.16,1:51:07.45,Default,,0,0,0,,这是你自己做的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You made this yourself?
Dialogue: 0,1:51:07.62,1:51:10.04,Default,,0,0,0,,-对！我现在很少做蛋糕了 -我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}-Yeah! I don't usually make the cakes. -I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:10.21,1:51:12.00,Default,,0,0,0,,上次做还是1997年的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the first one I've made since 1997.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:12.17,1:51:13.38,Default,,0,0,0,,你太有才了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a real artist.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:13.54,1:51:15.50,Default,,0,0,0,,这一路走来起起落落\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's been a pretty wild ride.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:15.67,1:51:18.09,Default,,0,0,0,,前一天才被芭斯罗缤开除\N{\fnArial\fs30}One day you're fired from Baskin-Robbins...
Dialogue: 0,1:51:18.26,1:51:21.05,Default,,0,0,0,,第二天就打赢了穿越时空的宇宙魔王\N{\fnArial\fs30}the next you're beating a time-traveling space king.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:22.14,1:51:24.10,Default,,0,0,0,,是打赢了吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}We did beat him, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:51:25.56,1:51:26.77,Default,,0,0,0,,就是这么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, yeah, that's what happened.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:26.93,1:51:29.10,Default,,0,0,0,,他想逃走但没逃成\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was getting out and he didn't get out.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:30.56,1:51:31.65,Default,,0,0,0,,应该吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:33.15,1:51:35.73,Default,,0,0,0,,可他还说要是他没逃出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he also said something bad was coming...
Dialogue: 0,1:51:36.15,1:51:39.24,Default,,0,0,0,,那就会出大事 大家都会死\N{\fnArial\fs30}and that everyone would die if he didn't get out.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:39.40,1:51:42.03,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 这么说我把大家给害了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. So, did I just kill everyone?
Dialogue: 0,1:51:42.74,1:51:44.78,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我干的事大家都要死了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is everyone gonna die because of me?
Dialogue: 0,1:51:44.95,1:51:46.08,Default,,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:47.20,1:51:48.66,Default,,0,0,0,,天…我干了什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh my... What did I do?
Dialogue: 0,1:51:50.87,1:51:52.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我干了什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did I do?
Dialogue: 0,1:51:55.75,1:51:57.84,Default,,0,0,0,,算了 应该没什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what? It's probably fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:58.38,1:52:00.47,Default,,0,0,0,,生活中荒唐的事多了去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like I said, life doesn't make any sense...
Dialogue: 0,1:52:00.63,1:52:03.76,Default,,0,0,0,,何必问这问那纠结这么多呢 斯科特\N{\fnArial\fs30}so maybe stop asking so many questions, Scott.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:03.93,1:52:05.39,Default,,0,0,0,,别想太多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop overthinking it.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:07.89,1:52:09.68,Default,,0,0,0,,惊喜！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Surprise!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:09.85,1:52:13.98,Default,,0,0,0,,祝你生日快乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Happy Birthday to you
Dialogue: 0,1:52:15.19,1:52:16.52,Default,,0,0,0,,今天不是我生日\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not my birthday.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:16.69,1:52:19.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道 前几年你生日我不在\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know. But I missed a few.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:21.61,1:52:23.49,Default,,0,0,0,,这样就好 平安团圆\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is good. We're all together.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:23.86,1:52:25.28,Default,,0,0,0,,没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:25.45,1:52:28.37,Default,,0,0,0,,应该不会发生什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything's probably fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:28.54,1:52:30.87,Default,,0,0,0,,康不在了 你赢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kang's gone. You did it.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:32.00,1:52:33.75,Default,,0,0,0,,把他的事抛到脑后去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't have to worry about that guy anymore.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:33.92,1:52:34.92,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:38.42,1:52:40.42,Default,,0,0,0,,不是生日的生日快乐 凯茜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Happy fake birthday, Cassie.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:00.52,1:55:07.53,Default,,0,0,0,,《蚁人与黄蜂女：量子狂潮》
Dialogue: 0,1:55:18.29,1:55:21.88,Default,,0,0,0,,那个被流放的家伙死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, the exiled one is dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:24.17,1:55:26.09,Default,,0,0,0,,你确定他死了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sure he's dead?
Dialogue: 0,1:55:26.71,1:55:29.59,Default,,0,0,0,,要是假消息 我也不会叫你们来\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it wasn't true, I wouldn't call you.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:30.22,1:55:33.35,Default,,0,0,0,,他没死在你手里 你一定气坏了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Must really eat you up, that you're not the one who killed him.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:33.68,1:55:36.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我们谁都没能…\N{\fnArial\fs30}None of us...
Dialogue: 0,1:55:37.18,1:55:38.89,Default,,0,0,0,,把他杀死\N{\fnArial\fs30}killed him.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:41.19,1:55:42.56,Default,,0,0,0,,他们做到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They did.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:43.44,1:55:47.99,Default,,0,0,0,,他们开始接触多元宇宙了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're beginning to touch the Multiverse.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:48.65,1:55:50.11,Default,,0,0,0,,如果放任不管…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if we let them...
Dialogue: 0,1:55:50.57,1:55:52.41,Default,,0,0,0,,他们会夺走…\N{\fnArial\fs30}they will take...
Dialogue: 0,1:55:53.82,1:55:55.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我们建立的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}everything...
Dialogue: 0,1:55:56.37,1:55:58.37,Default,,0,0,0,,所有成果\N{\fnArial\fs30}we've built.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:59.41,1:56:01.96,Default,,0,0,0,,都别再浪费时间了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So let's stop wasting time.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:05.59,1:56:06.80,Default,,0,0,0,,要晚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're late.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:08.80,1:56:11.13,Default,,0,0,0,,你叫来了多少？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many did you call?
Dialogue: 0,1:56:11.47,1:56:13.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我们所有的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of us.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:29.61,2:03:31.62,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,2:03:36.79,2:03:41.79,Default,,0,0,0,,时间即是一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time is everything.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:43.09,2:03:46.00,Default,,0,0,0,,(维克托·坦姆利)
Dialogue: 0,2:03:47.05,2:03:50.05,Default,,0,0,0,,它塑造我们的一生\N{\fnArial\fs30}It shapes our lives.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:51.34,2:03:55.31,Default,,0,0,0,,或许我们也能重塑…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, perhaps, we can shape...
Dialogue: 0,2:03:57.10,2:03:58.18,Default,,0,0,0,,时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}it.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:59.43,2:04:00.56,Default,,0,0,0,,就是他\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's him.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:00.98,2:04:04.27,Default,,0,0,0,,干嘛？你这语气搞得好像他是什么大魔王\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? You made him sound like this terrifying figure.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:05.94,2:04:07.03,Default,,0,0,0,,他就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:14.24,2:04:18.08,Default,,0,0,0,,康将卷土重来
